cates the frequently used information and maps required during gameplay. This second document allows players of the PDF version of <i>Beyond the Morning Mountains</i> to retain their current page when referring to information found elsewhere within Volume One.\n\n<br /><br />This PDF also serves as a preview document for those desiring to sample the game rules or view the general quality of the adventure, and provides printable map files for those playing the printed editions.\n\n<br /><br />Thanks to Ryan Lynch and the author for sharing the document for inclusion here.',4),(752,'Fabled Lands #7 Character Sheet','/scans/FabledLands/07sheet.gif','Thanks to sireeyore for the scan.',4),(753,'Grosse Spielbücher no. 1 Character Sheet, Das','/scans/DasGrosse/01sheet.gif','Thanks to Florian Kalenda for sharing this scan.',4),(754,'Way of the Tiger Computer Game Ad #2, The','/gallery/ads/ComputerGamer/14_p049_wott.jpg','This advertisement for the <a href=\"/Item/10515\">Way of the Tiger computer game</a> comes from <a href=\"/Series/1903\">Computer Gamer</a> issue 14, page 49. Identical ads also appeared in issue 13, page 7 and issue 15, page 49. Thanks to Ryan Lynch for sharing the image.',3),(755,'Sagard the Barbarian ad (version 1)','/gallery/ads/ComputerGamer/11_p051_sagard.jpg','This advertisement for <a href=\"/Series/200\">Sagard the Barbarian</a> comes from <a href=\"/Series/1903\">Computer Gamer</a> issue 11, page 51. Thanks to Ryan Lynch for sharing the image.',3),(756,'Sagard the Barbarian ad (version 2)','/gallery/ads/ComputerGamer/20_p016_sagard.jpg','This advertisement for <a href=\"/Series/200\">Sagard the Barbarian</a> comes from <a href=\"/Series/1903\">Computer Gamer</a> issue 20, page 16. Thanks to Ryan Lynch for sharing the image.',3),(757,'Steve Jackson\'s Swordmaster Advertisement #3','/gallery/ads/ComputerGamer/01_p037_swordmaster.jpg','This advertisement for <a href=\"/Series/2010\">Steve Jackson\'s Swordmaster</a> comes from <a href=\"/Series/1903\">Computer Gamer</a> issue 1, page 37. The same ad (differing only in size) also ran on page 24 of <a href=\"/Series/2012\">Micro Adventurer</a> issue 17 (<a href=\"/Item/11954\">March 1985</a>). Thanks to Ryan Lynch for sharing the image.',3),(758,'Proteus #3 Ad','/gallery/ads/ComputerGamer/09_p044_proteus.jpg','This advertisement for <a href=\"/Item/1951\">Shinderg\'s Tomb</a> comes from <a href=\"/Series/1903\">Computer Gamer</a> issue 9, page 44. Thanks to Ryan Lynch for sharing the image.',3),(759,'Way of the Tiger Computer Game Ad #1, The','/gallery/ads/ComputerGamer/11_p061_wott.jpg','This advertisement for the <a href=\"/Item/10515\">Way of the Tiger computer game</a> comes from <a href=\"/Series/1903\">Computer Gamer</a> issue 11, page 62. Thanks to Ryan Lynch for sharing the image.',3),(760,'Rebel Planet Computer Game Ad','/gallery/ads/ComputerGamer/13_p047_rp.jpg','This advertisement for the <a href=\"/Item/10299\">Rebel Planet computer game</a> comes from <a href=\"/Series/1903\">Computer Gamer</a> issue 13, page 47. Thanks to Ryan Lynch for sharing the image.',3),(761,'Tunnels and Trolls \"At Last!\" Advertisement','/gallery/ads/ComputerGamer/13_p051_tnt.jpg','This advertisement for the Corgi edition of <a href=\"/Series/111\">Tunnels and Trolls</a> comes from <a href=\"/Series/1903\">Computer Gamer</a> issue 13, page 51. Thanks to Ryan Lynch for sharing the image.',3),(762,'Avenger Computer Game Ad','/gallery/ads/ComputerGamer/19_p010-011_avenger.jpg','This advertisement for the <a href=\"/Item/10516\">Avenger</a> computer game comes from <a href=\"/Series/1903\">Computer Gamer</a> issue 19, pages 10-11. The identical ad also appeared in issue 20, pages 24-25; issue 21, pages 26-27; and issue 22, pages 10-11. Thanks to Ryan Lynch for sharing the image.',3),(763,'Warlock Advertisement','/gallery/ads/MicroAdventurer/07_p10_warlock.jpg','This advertisement from the May 1984 issue of <a href=\"/Series/2012\">Micro Adventurer</a> announces the <a href=\"/Item/1032\">first issue</a> of <a href=\"/Series/156\">Warlock</a> magazine. Thanks to Ryan Lynch for sharing the image.',3),(764,'Lone Wolf Computer Game \"You Swear Revenge\" Ad','/gallery/ads/MicroAdventurer/12_p18-19_lw.jpg','This advertisement relates to the first two <a href=\"/Series/397\">Lone Wolf computer games</a> and was published on pages 18-19 of the <a href=\"/Item/11944\">October 1984</a> issue of <a href=\"/Series/2012\">Micro Adventurer</a>. Thanks to Ryan Lynch for the image.',3),(765,'Micro Adventure Ad','/gallery/ads/MicroAdventurer/14_p37_ma.jpg','This ad for the <a href=\"/Series/1163\">Micro Adventure</a> series comes from the <a href=\"/Item/11950\">December 1984</a> issue of <a href=\"/Series/2012\">Micro Adventurer</a>. Thanks to Ryan Lynch for the image.',3),(766,'Steve Jackson\'s Swordmaster Advertisement #1','/gallery/ads/MicroAdventurer/15_p34-41_sm.jpg','This advertisement for <a href=\"/Series/2010\">Steve Jackson\'s Swordmaster</a> ran along the bottoms of pages 35, 36, 40 and 41 in <a href=\"/Series/2012\">Micro Adventurer</a> issue 15 (<a href=\"/Item/11952\">January 1985</a>). Thanks to Ryan Lynch for sharing the image.',3),(767,'Steve Jackson\'s Swordmaster Advertisement #2','/gallery/ads/MicroAdventurer/16_p31_sm.jpg','This advertisement for <a href=\"/Series/2010\">Steve Jackson\'s Swordmaster</a> ran on page 31 in <a href=\"/Series/2012\">Micro Adventurer</a> issue 16 (February 1985). Thanks to Ryan Lynch for sharing the image.',3),(768,'Pick-a-Path Apocalypse #1 Autographed Title Page','/gallery/papapoc/01auto.jpg','',2),(769,'Pick-a-Path Apocalypse #2 Autographed Title Page','/gallery/papapoc/02auto.jpg','',2),(770,'Twistaplot # 1 Structure Diagram','/scans/Twistaplot/01map.png','Thanks to Ryan Lynch for sharing this.',6),(771,'Twistaplot # 2 Structure Diagram','/scans/Twistaplot/02map.png','Thanks to Ryan Lynch for sharing this.',6),(772,'Twistaplot # 3 Structure Diagram','/scans/Twistaplot/03map.png','Thanks to Ryan Lynch f