g this map of the book\'s structure.',6),(816,'Caleb\'s Quest Structure Diagram','/gallery/contribs/2023/12/27/caleb-map.jpg','Thanks to Rachel Helps for sharing this diagram.',6),(817,'Metagaming: New Micros ad','/gallery/contribs/2023/12/27/Dragon_ad_54_p.19.png','from <a href=\"/Series/118\">Dragon</a> #54, page 19. Also reprinted in #55, page 72 and #56, page 59. Thanks to Pedro Panhoca for the scan.',3),(818,'Time Traveler ad','/gallery/contribs/2023/12/27/timejr_ad.jpg','This advertisement was printed in the back of the first printing of the Bantam Skylark edition of <i>The Castle in the Attic</i> by Elizabeth Winthrop, published September, 1986.',3),(819,'ACE Gamebooks #1 Autograph','/gallery/contribs/2023/12/28/aliceauto.jpg','',2),(820,'ACE Gamebooks #5 Autograph','/gallery/contribs/2023/12/28/twasauto.jpg','',2),(821,'Metal Heroes and the Fate of Rock Autograph','/gallery/contribs/2023/12/29/metalheroesauto.jpg','',2),(822,'QuestWorld Map','/gallery/contribs/2024/08/09/QuestWorld-map-and-index-v1.3.pdf','This PDF map, assembled by amateur creator Travis Henry with input from Rose Estes, creates a world map and setting for the <a href=\"/Series/79\">Endless Quest</a> books and other TSR-published gamebooks. A <a href=\"/gallery/contribs/2024/08/09/QuestWorld-map-v1.3.png\">png version</a> and <a href=\"/gallery/contribs/2024/08/09/QuestWorld-history.pdf\">PDF containing related communication and historical context</a> are also available. The files are shared with permission.',4),(823,'Dinah-Mite #1 Character Sheet','/gallery/contribs/2024/09/03/dm1sheet.jpg','Thanks to the author for sharing this image.',4),(824,'Dinah-Mite #2 Character Sheet','/gallery/contribs/2024/09/03/dm2sheet.jpg','Thanks to the author for sharing this image.',4),(825,'mystiska påsen Structure Diagram, Den','/gallery/contribs/2024/10/17/dmp-diagram.jpg','',6),(826,'Graphic Novel Adventures Season 4 Errata Sheet','/gallery/contribs/2024/11/30/gna4errata.jpg','',4),(827,'Marvel Superheroes Adventure Gamebook #7 Bookmark','/gallery/contribs/2024/12/14/atwb-bookmark.jpg','Thanks to Marc Tassin for sharing this image.',4),(828,'enigma do sol oculto Adventure Sheet, O','/gallery/contribs/2025/02/12/oedso_adventure_sheet.jpg','Thanks to Pedro Panhoca for sharing the image.',4),(829,'enigma do sol oculto Initial Adventure Sheet, O','/gallery/contribs/2025/02/12/oedso_initial_adventure_sheet.jpg','Thanks to Pedro Panhoca for sharing the image.',4),(830,'enigma do sol oculto Cemetery Sheet, O','/gallery/contribs/2025/02/12/oedso_cemetery_sheet.jpg','Thanks to Pedro Panhoca for sharing the image.',4),(831,'enigma do sol oculto Photo Album, O','/gallery/contribs/2025/02/12/oedso_photo_album.jpg','Thanks to Pedro Panhoca for sharing the image.',4),(832,'enigma do sol oculto Trophy Room, O','/gallery/contribs/2025/02/12/oedso_trophy_room.jpg','Thanks to Pedro Panhoca for sharing the image.',4),(833,'Duel Master #1 Map','/gallery/contribs/2025/04/20/dm_map.jpg','Thanks to Gabe Atkinson for sharing this image.',4),(834,'Dragontales # 3 Structure Diagram','/gallery/contribs/2025/07/05/dt3.png','Thanks to criver for contributing this map. The <a href=\"/gallery/contribs/2025/07/05/dt3.dot\">DOT source file</a> is also available.\n\n<p>Notes from the contributor: You\'ll find instructions how to visualize it in the playground of graphviz. There are comments in the DOT file that are spoilery, but they do not show up in the graphics. Finally, one of the nodes is called unknown and marked by a \"?\" node - this is because the scan from which I read this book was missing a large part of section 31, so I don\'t know whether it merges with some other section or whether it ends there.',6),(835,'Lone Wolf #32 Character Sheet (Lone Wolf, page 1)','/gallery/contribs/2026/05/19/lw32-3.png','Thanks to Ben Devere and Holmgard Press for sharing this file.',4),(836,'Lone Wolf #32 Character Sheet (Lone Wolf, page 2)','/gallery/contribs/2026/05/19/lw32-4.png','Thanks to Ben Devere and Holmgard Press for sharing this file.',4),(837,'Lone Wolf #32 Character Sheet (Lorn Commander, page 1)','/gallery/contribs/2026/05/19/lw32-1.png','Thanks to Ben Devere and Holmgard Press for sharing this file.',4),(838,'Lone Wolf #32 Character Sheet (Lorn Commander, page 2)','/gallery/contribs/2026/05/19/lw32-2.png','Thanks to Ben Devere and Holmgard Press for sharing this file.',4);
