Thanks to Ben Nelson for the British cover scan.',1),(2344,'Weird Zone, The','','Thanks to Brett Easterbrook for the British cover scan.',1),(2345,'Dimension of Doom','','',1),(2346,'Lost Planet, The','','',1),(2347,'Moons of Mystery','','',1),(2348,'Haunted Planet, The','','',1),(2349,'1789','','',1),(2350,'Vous êtes l\'As des As','','',1),(2351,'Voleur de Karass, Le','','',1),(2352,'Trésor aux maléfices, Le','','Thanks to Kuronons for the scans.',1),(2353,'Epreuve de la tour noire, L\'','','',1),(2354,'Défi du Ninja, Le','','',1),(2355,'Star Wars Episode I Adventures Adventure Guide','The biggest flaw of this book (aside from the cheap paper it\'s printed on) is its failure to mention whether the zero on the ten-sided die represents zero or ten. Experience with playing the game suggests that it counts as ten, however.','',3),(2356,'Search for the Lost Jedi','','',1),(2357,'Bartokk Assassins, The','The Z-95 Headhunter card should list the vehicle as a space-type craft, not a land-type craft.','',1),(2358,'Fury of Darth Maul, The','The last sentence of page 96 should read \"If targeting is not one of your talents, your roll# + your weaponry# + your vehicle\'s weaponry# is your adventure#.\"','',1),(2359,'Jedi Emergency','','',1),(2360,'Ghostling Children, The','','',1),(2361,'Hunt for Anakin Skywalker, The','','',1),(2362,'Capture Arawynne','','',1),(2363,'Trouble on Tatooine','On page 42, the Movement power is used. Unfortunately, there is no Movement power; the book is probably referring to the Motion power.','Thanks to ntar for the reissue cover scan.',1),(2364,'Rescue in the Core','','',1),(2365,'Festival of Warriors','On page 80, you are instructed to do one thing if your adventure# is equal to or more than 14 or a different thing if it is less than 17. This presents an obvious inconsistency, but it is unclear which number is the correct one.','',1),(2366,'Pirates from Beyond the Sea','On page 40, the Aim skill is accidentally referred to as the Marksmanship skill; this is probably a relic from an earlier draft.','',1),(2367,'Bongo Rally, The','On page 97, the Knockdown skill is mentioned; this is almost certainly an erroneous reference to the Knockout skill.','',1),(2368,'Danger on Naboo','','',1),(2369,'Podrace to Freedom','On page 87 of the first edition, it says what to do if you have the decision talent, but it doesn\'t say what to do if you don\'t. Perhaps it\'s worth omitting the knowledge# from the equation to keep things fair, but this is just a random guess. Additionally, on page 105, the reader is instructed to turn to page \"TK\" of the novel. The page number should, in fact, be 61.','',1),(2370,'Final Battle, The','On page 140, it says to turn to \"You whiz by the walls\" on page 146; the phrase in question is actually on page 142. Additionally, on page 149, there\'s a <b>To outrun the fireball (without Power)</b> heading even though there is no option to use power.','Thanks to J. Carr for pointing out this title and providing the images.',1),(2371,'Confidentially Yours','','',1),(2372,'Breaking Up is Hard to Do','','',1),(2373,'Book of Wizardry, The','','',1),(2374,'Star Wars Gamer #10','','',8),(2375,'Jedi\'s Legacy','','',7),(2376,'Assault on Yavin Four','','',1),(2377,'Escape from Thyferra','','',1),(2378,'Attack on Delrakkin','','',1),(2379,'Destroy the Liquidator','','',1),(2380,'Hunt for Han Solo, The','','',1),(2381,'Search for Grubba the Hutt, The','','',1),(2382,'Ithorian Invasion','','',1),(2383,'Togorian Trap','','',1),(2384,'Revolt of the Battle Droids','','',1),(2385,'Showdown in Mos Eisley','','',1),(2386,'Bounty Hunter vs. Battle Droids','','',1),(2387,'Vactooine Disaster, The','','',1),(2388,'Prisoners of the Nikto Pirates','','',1),(2389,'Monsters of Dweem, The','','',1),(2390,'Voyage to the Underworld','','',1),(2391,'Imperial Jailbreak','','',1),(2392,'Darth Vader\'s Return','','',1),(2393,'Rogue Squadron to the Rescue','','',1),(2394,'Bounty on Bonadan','','',1),(2395,'Total Destruction',