INSERT INTO `Items_Descriptions` VALUES (1,'User','Dick Tracy follows a trail that begins with five unidentified corpses....'),(2,'User','You live the life of Keith Marion, an Englishman born in 1959, from birth until death.'),(3,'User','You are Robin Hood. News reaches you that Sir Jean du Melusine, a dangerous Frenchman, has arrived in England to assist the evil King John. Obviously, you decide to do something about this unfortunate event....'),(4,'User','You ambush a mysterious Templar Knight who possesses a powerful black sword, and you are compelled to learn more about him....'),(10,'User','You must rescue a young prince and retrieve valuable jewels from an evil interplanetary criminal named Phatax.'),(11,'User','Marko Khen, an evil space pirate, has been mutating harmless animals into huge monsters and using them to terrorize innocent planets. You must find and stop him.'),(12,'User','An experiment to see if robots can be used as settlers goes terribly wrong when the robots involved decide to destroy humans for their imperfection. You must stop the rebellion and rescue Dr. Cyberg, the creator of the robots.'),(13,'User','An evil spy named Gresh wishes to sabotage the first Space Olympics, and you must stop him while protecting the superathlete Andromeda.'),(14,'User','A report of attacking monsters in a distant sector sends you on a mission to go farther from Spy Center than any agent has ever before gone, using an experimental X-wing (!) spacecraft.'),(15,'User','You must guard the Star Crystal, a priceless jewel, as it is transported on an unusual ship known as the Moebius Express.'),(16,'User','You must find and defeat a rebel intent on destroying the Interplanetary Spy organization.'),(17,'User','You receive a call from your old friend the biodroid, but when you soon discover that the planet he called from has disappeared.'),(18,'User','The evil brother of agent Tunk is attempting to use mind control to sabotage the training of the Ultraheroes, a group of superheroes who are presently learning how best to fight evil. You must find out whose mind he is controlling and stop him before it\'s too late!'),(19,'User','You must capture the Planet Hunters, a trio of fiendish criminals who destroy entire planets for sport.'),(20,'User','To prevent an interplanetary war, you must retrieve a treaty lost in space centuries ago.'),(21,'User','A villain named Skystalker has stolen the Romular Sphere, an ancient and valuable artifact. Unfortunately, he is unaware of the fact that its contents are capable of destroying the entire universe! You must recover the Sphere before it is unwittingly opened!'),(22,'User','You\'ve invented a velcro board for holding pens in zero gravity, so NASA declares you a genius and decides to send you to the moon on Apollo 13. No, I\'m not making this up.'),(23,'LC','As Lifin, a young elf, the reader makes decisions controlling his search through the five Forbidden Towers for the herb that will cure his people of the elven plague.'),(24,'LC','The reader, as Robin the minstrel, follows a path of perils through the Forgotten Forest, making decisions which determine whether he will end up a hero or a prisoner of thieves.'),(25,'LC','As a dweller in the Forgotten Forest, the reader makes decisions determining the course of the story as his pet beast becomes trapped in the manor house of the Master of Mazes.'),(26,'LC','The reader, as apprentice to the wizard Caladrius, becomes involved in a war of the wizards, during the course of which the reader\'s choices determine the development of the plot.'),(36,'User','The great sword that allows the shogun of Hachiman to rule has been stolen, and  you, as his greatest warrior, must find it before the forces of evil can harness its powers.'),(37,'User','You travel to Firetop Mountain, a dangerous place inhabited by Zagor the Warlock, in search of treasure and adventure.'),(38,'User','You are a wizard-in-training sent to infiltrate the citadel of Balthus Dire, an evil demi-sorcerer. Your mission is to prevent him from unleashing an army upon the innocent Vale of Willow by assassinating him in his lair.'),(39,'User','You encounter a dying dwarf and decide to finish the quest that he gave his life attempting to complete: to enter a dangerous, monster-filled forest in search of a precious hammer that the dwarfs of Stonebridge need to fight off the trolls that threaten their home.'),(40,'User','Your spacecraft has been pulled through a black hole into a parallel universe, and you must somehow find your way back home.'),(41,'User','While visiting the town of Silverton you get involved in a quest to lift a curse by defeating the evil Zanbar Bone. Unfortunately, in order to learn how to destroy the fiend, you must seek the advice of an old wizard who lives in the dangerous and crime-infested Port Blacksand.'),(42,'User','You are hired to find and destroy an evil demon who keeps the soul of a dead man imprisoned.'),(43,'User','Every year, the town of Fang celebrates the Trial of Champions, a special event in which adventurers are sent into Baron Sukumvit\'s deadly, trap-filled dungeon. The one resourceful soul capable of surviving all the way through will win a vast prize. So far, no one has won, but there\'s a first time for everything, and you\'re determined to give it a shot....'),(44,'User','While visiting an old friend, you discover that his village has been attacked by reptilian kidnappers from a nearby island; you vow to stop their foul activities....'),(45,'User','You\'ve acquired a magical ring which allows you to detect evil and always identify north, so you figure it\'s time to make a map of the unmappable Scorpion Swamp; of course, the patronage of a mage adds further incentive....'),(46,'User','A simple job involving the protection of a caravan eventually turns into an expedition into the icy passages of the evil Snow Witch....'),(47,'User','Your car breaks down in an isolated area on a rainy night, forcing you to take shelter at the nearest house, which unfortunately is brimming over with evil!'),(48,'User','You have been transported by mysterious beings from Earth to the land of Orb, where you must save that world by keeping a dangerous artifact out of evil hands.'),(49,'User','When word reaches your planet that a mad scientist plans to release a horrific plague, you are the futuristic assassin hired to bring him to justice.'),(50,'User','Civilization has been wiped out by a disease; you are a member of a surviving settlement, and you must travel through lawless lands to retrieve a petrol supply.'),(51,'User','Malbordus, a human adopted  by evil elves, is seeking five dragon artifacts with which he can conquer the world; you must find them first and stop him.'),(52,'User','You are a futuristic narcotics officer looking to infiltrate and destroy the drug smuggling ring of the notorious Blaster Babbet.'),(55,'User','The human race has been conquered by the powerful Arcadians, and you are an interplanetary secret agent on a desperate mission to learn a secret code that will allow you to enter and destroy the nerve center of the empire.'),(57,'User','You are a slave to the evil brother of Lord Sukumvit, famous as the creator of Deathtrap Dungeon. Supposing you survive his arena, you will be his entrant in the newly renovated dungeon.'),(58,'User','You wake up one morning to find that all your countrymen have been placed in a deep sleep, and your ancient enemies have launched an all-out invasion with their robot army!'),(66,'User','The Gromulans have kidnapped the Galactic President and taken him to a backwater planet called Earth. As the galaxy\'s top Rogue Tracer, only you can hope to rescue him in time.'),(67,'User','You venture into a remote jungle region in search of a\r\ntemple built by a lost civilization, which is thought to contain a\r\npriceless idol. Along the way you discover your evil nemesis is\r\nlooking for the relic as well...'),(68,'User','During a rainy night you seek refuge in a strange house in the middle of a wood.  Soon after you learn that an evil vampire lives in the crypt below it, and you vow to seek and destroy him.'),(69,'User','While the king was away on a crusade, the provisional ruler was turned into a vampire and enslaved by the evil wizard Arkayn Darkrobe.  Weakened by Darkrobe\'s sorcery, the king turns to you for help.  Can you reach the wizard\'s castle, brave its many dangers and slay him?'),(70,'User','A formerly-sunken city has resurfaced, and a powerful relic called The Eye of the Dragon has been found there by an expedition.  You are hired to locate the members of the expedition and recover the Eye.  However, as soon as you arrive, you discover something is amiss...'),(71,'User','You travel to an Egypt-like realm in search of a Pharaoh\'s tomb which is rumoured to contain fabulous treasure. '),(80,'User','A year after becoming the second winner of the Deathtrap Dungeon trial (as told in the FF book <a href=\"/Item/57\">Trial of Champions</a>), you set off with an army to stop a Shadow Demon from conquering the land of Allansia.'),(82,'User','The people of a tiny village turn to you when one of their own is carried off by an evil vampire.'),(88,'User','The five demonic riders known as the Shadow Warriors have appeared, and you must find them and their infernal master before it\'s too late.'),(89,'User','Out of nowhere, a strange creature gives you a magical sphere that contains the entire multiverse, and asks you to deliver it to its master for safekeeping.'),(92,'User','Karam Gruul the war criminal has returned, and soon his nightmarish legions will overrun the land... unless YOU can stop him.'),(95,'User','You must journey to Castle Argent and kill the Zagor-Demon.'),(102,'User','Reiner Heydrich wasn\'t quite as dead as we all hoped, and unless you can stop him, he\'ll terrorize the land in search of blood once again.'),(104,'User','This book contains the magic rules required by the rest of this series.  Eventually, its contents were reprinted within the gamebooks and it was no longer necessary for play.'),(105,'User','You set off on a mission to recover the Crown of Kings, a vitally important magic item which has been stolen by an evil Archmage.'),(128,'User','You travel through the city of Goldstar at night, having a different adventure depending on which pre-created character you choose to play as.'),(129,'User','You are Bern Vallenshield, a ranger in the world of Krynn (from the <b>Dragonlance</b> campaign setting). When you return to your home town of Solace you discover that it has been destroyed by dragons and that your younger brother is in danger!'),(130,'User','A resident of the world of Greyhawk, you are falsely accused of theft. The only way to clear your name is to retrieve a dangerous magical artifact from a mysterious spectral tower accompanied by two strangers who may or may not desire to kill you.'),(131,'User','You are Derek Shadowalker, a retired thief of the Robin Hood variety. An old friend informs you that the king\'s present cruelty is due to an evil sorcerer and a magical gem, so you set out to put things right.'),(132,'User','As Raistlin Majere (of <b>Dragonlance</b> fame), you must pass the test of the Towers of High Sorcery to become a full-fledged magic-user.'),(133,'User','You are a samurai in training and must pass many challenges on your way to becoming a warrior.'),(134,'User','You are Jeren Sureblade, a high-level paladin. You must defeat the evil vampire Count Strahd von Zarovich in his dangerous home in order to save a young girl from becoming one of the undead.'),(135,'User','You are Carr Delling, son of an incredibly powerful (but long deceased) mage. Following the death of your mother, you set off in search of your father\'s legacy to you.'),(136,'User','You and your friend Mjolnir, a dwarven thief, must recover a magical gem stolen by the evil witch Baba Yaga.'),(137,'User','Once again playing the role of Carr Delling, you must go on a journey to unravel a mystery involving an old rival and corrupted paladins.'),(138,'User','As Gilthanas the elf, you must discover the fate of the good dragons\' eggs, which have been stolen by the forces of evil.'),(139,'User','You are Feral, a warrior cursed by an evil wizard to transform into a wolf. You set off in search of vengeance and a cure.'),(140,'User','You must prevent your rival Arno from releasing a terrible monster and acquiring a magical item of great power.'),(141,'User','You are Wyn the Younger, an aspiring paladin. As penance for starting a bar fight you are sent on a dangerous quest to recover the Breath of Life from the Gates of Death in order to save a princess.'),(142,'User','As Kardel Arthur Dolan, a young nobleman, you must recover five stolen plaques needed by your father to defend against an army of trolls. On your journey you are accompanied by a wizard and a thief, neither of whom you entirely trust.'),(143,'User','You are Sir Theobold Redbeard, a great fighter who rules the dominion of Lighthall. When extradimensional magic takes your city away from you, you must gather magical coins and combat a sorcerer to rescue your subjects.'),(144,'User','You awaken in the company of a cleric named Lorina and realize that you have no idea who you are. The only clues to your identity are a ring, a feather and a bag of herbs....'),(145,'User','As the half-elf ranger Kelson Darktreader, you must defend the town of Daggerford against devils, orcs and goblins.'),(146,'User','You are Jadd Hachen, a thief of the Robin Hood variety. Unfortunately for you, some gems you have recently acquired have been stolen by fellow thieves. Even worse, you are being pursued by extradimensional monsters which think you still have the stones. You must retrieve the gems before they can be used to bring about the end of the world!'),(147,'User','A party of adventurers wanders through a dungeon searching for the Holy Talisman of St. Cuthbert.'),(162,'User','Your ship is wrecked by a huge wave and you must find a way to survive on an isolated and dangerous island.'),(163,'LC','While exploring the seas for the lost continent of Atlantis, you are separated from your diving vessel. By choosing specific pages, you determine the outcome.'),(163,'User','You are an undersea explorer in search of Atlantis.'),(168,'LC','Alone on a secluded lake, the reader encounters alien construction workers at work on an anti-gravity building site. The reader\'s choices determine the outcome of the plot.'),(169,'LC','Drawn into a computer and out again into an alien spaceship, the reader must figure out a way to get back home.'),(170,'LC','The reader may choose the direction of the plot as aliens from outer space arrive on Earth, purportedly to warn of a terrible disaster.'),(171,'LC','On a class trip to Earth from outer space, a group of aliens turn a town upside down with their antics. As one of the townspeople, the reader makes choices about the outcome of the plot.'),(178,'User','A young man sets out to visit his eccentric, amusement-park-designing uncle and ends up running across the remains of an experiment which lead him to adventures involving dimensions beyond the usual three.'),(179,'User','An American linguist gets drawn into bizarre circumstances as a result of researching the ancient Olmec language in a remote area of Mexico.'),(180,'User','An American student visiting England has a strange encounter with a painting at the National Gallery and finds himself haunted by the ghost of a woman who died a hundred years earlier.'),(181,'User','A science-fiction-writing construction worker stumbles upon a dimensional gateway on a job site and finds himself on an alien world.'),(182,'User','A starship captain and his empathic alien friend look for work and find themselves involved with a new kind of jewel that proves somewhat dangerous to produce.'),(183,'User','A sign advertising cheap gasoline lures a young girl into a dangerous situation.'),(185,'User','You and your friends run into a dying alien being who tells you about an evil extraterrestrial race trying to take over all the humans living on Earth. He then gives you all the power to morph into animals and sends you over to fight the enemies.'),(194,'User','The Gaulish chief Vitalstatistix (Abraracourcix in the French original) has temporarily left his village, taking the warriors Asterix and Obelix with him. A chief from a neighbouring village is requesting that Vitalstatistix be on schedule for a customary chief meeting, or his people will ally with the Roman invaders. You must set off on a journey to locate Vitalstatistix and bring him back to his village in time for the meeting.'),(220,'User','You are the Batman. While patrolling Gotham City you discover a burglary taking place in a warehouse, and decide to investigate. '),(256,'LC','Fourteen-year-old Brenton questions the choices in his life when an alien anthropologist arrives to study an ancient Aboriginal tribe that once lived in the area around his home.'),(259,'User','Blackstone and two amateur detectives, Amanda and Alex Roberts, must investigate the construction site of what will be the world\'s tallest building, where supernatural events have supposedly been occurring. The investigation leads to all sorts of strange events involving Egypt, rock stars, alchemy and, of course, magicians.'),(260,'User','Cal and Rita, two of Blackstone\'s assistants, try to catch a jewel thief called Gentleman Jack who has returned after forty years to the Falcon Cliff Lodge, once a favorite vacation spot for movie stars.'),(261,'User','Nina and Teddy Wise must save their family\'s circus from bankruptcy. They can do this either by searching for an old family treasure or by developing anti-gravity boots.'),(262,'User','The discovery of a secret room in an attic leads TJ and Marti Linderman, the children of Blackstone\'s cousin, to try to find a previously unknown American artifact - George Washington\'s crown.'),(263,'User','Tom and Alice Kingsley travel with their father, a history teacher, to Stonehenge, where they meet Blackstone and search for Druids.'),(275,'User','You wander into the town of Mad Mesa and have some adventures there at night.'),(278,'User','This genre spoof takes place primarily in a bordello and is rife with literary and role-playing allusions.'),(281,'User','It is the beginning of the twentieth century, and you hope to make your fortune by searching China for a missing archaeologist; if you can him or the ancient cave of treasures he sought, you will be richly rewarded.'),(284,'User','This adventure, dealing with mysterious events in the coastal town of Dove\'s Bay, is sold as a folder containing seven booklets and a variety of handouts.  Six of the booklets contain solitaire-play entries for different locations, while the seventh offers notes for adapting the material to group play.'),(287,'User','You have twenty-four hours to rescue the daughter of the president of Louisiana from an oil baron; if you fail, he will force her to marry him, thus getting that much closer to taking the presidency for himself.'),(288,'User','You are given an important courier job and soon end up working against a group of bloodthirsty anarchists.'),(289,'User','You\'re an autoduellist whose friend is a famous inventor. Unfortunately, his latest creation, the RB-4 robot, creates a controversy which threatens your life.'),(290,'User','You must drive Orson Whitney, a controversial Church Elder, to San Francisco without letting him get killed in the process.'),(291,'User','You are an autoduellist looking to revive a sunken career; an opportunity arises when the government asks for your help in foiling a nuclear threat from a group of terrorists known as the Green Circle.'),(292,'User','You are a cloned agent of the nation of Texas, and you must defend your homeland from the nuclear threat of the old enemy who killed your previous body.'),(300,'User','Three treasures must be recovered from members of Carmen Sandiego\'s gang.'),(321,'LC','The reader\'s choices control the adventures of a group of friends who make a trip to Washington, D. C., to try out a new camera.'),(322,'LC','The reader\'s decisions control the adventures of a group of children in and around an abandoned gold mine, as they find out more about themselves and God.'),(323,'LC','The reader\'s choices decide the course of the action when a group of friends discover that someone is dumping toxic wastes near the ranch they are visiting.'),(326,'LC','The reader\'s choices control the adventures of Jake, who unwillingly goes off to a summer church camp that turns out to be more interesting than he could have imagined.'),(328,'LC','The reader\'s choices determine the course of action as a group of Christian friends dodge a gang and a crazy old man while riding their mountain bikes.'),(332,'LC','The reader, en route to the third planet from Altair to seek the source and meaning of extraterrestrial messages, is given choices to make determining the course of the spaceship and the survival of the crew.'),(332,'User','When alien signals are detected coming from a planet orbiting the distant star Altair, you are asked to travel into space to find their senders. On your journey you are accompanied by Captain Bud Stanton, Professor Henry Pickens, and Dr. Nera Vivaldi.'),(333,'LC','By following the instructions at the bottom of each page, the reader can have several different adventures in the Old West.'),(333,'User','You wander into the old west town of Deadwood City looking for a job and find, predictably enough, adventure.'),(334,'User','Your cousin, a pilot in Alaska, lets you tag along on one of his flights to take supplies to a scientific encampment. He is knocked out by a crate that comes loose during turbulence, and now you must pilot the plane to safety!'),(342,'User','You go to Japan with your best friend Chuck and your sensei Mr. Yamamoto to study the ancient art of Kendo, which is fencing using bamboo sticks. While there, Mr. Yamamoto disappears and you have to find him.'),(345,'User','You\'re a member of the women\'s swim team at the 1996 Summer Olympics. As soon as you get there, a competitor hands you evidence that she and her teammates have been coerced into taking performance enhancers.'),(347,'User','You are going back to your old boarding school in the Northeast, because it\'s one of the best schools in the country and sends most of its graduates to Ivy League colleges. As the title would suggest, things turn upside down when you walk into your dorm and see what appears to be your roommate\'s body hanging from the ceiling.'),(349,'User','You are a young science enthusiast who has been invited to collaborate with a renowned scientist who studies antimatter. The scientist has developed a portal that allows travel between our own universe and a parallel universe which is a mirror image of it. The adventure begins with both of you preparing to test this device. '),(361,'User','When you make friends with two Chinese-American boys who have been studying in your Tai Chi class, you quickly get forced into joining a Chinese gang called the Red Flowers, each member of which must get a tattoo as an initiation rite. From then on, you must try to bring the Red Flowers to justice.'),(367,'User','You are visiting your Aunt Lily in Southern Florida, near the Everglades. You soon encounter a creature that looks like a giant, hairy ant -- and which spins webs. More and more of them appear, and soon they get hungry....'),(371,'User','You are offered a summer job in a boat cruise to teach Judo to a billionaire\'s stepson.'),(372,'User','You move to a new town and decide to try out for the school\'s soccer team.'),(378,'User','Your aunt and cousins have just bought a new house, but there have been some strange things happening there... you decide to investigate.'),(381,'User','A new mall\'s being built in your town, but when you witness a suspicious meeting on the way to a friend\'s house, you\'re left to wonder if something sinister is going on.'),(392,'User','Billy has disappeared in search of the perfect Martial Art, and you must go across the world and find him.'),(396,'User','You and your friends fly your gliders for sport over the Baja California peninsula. Of course, this being the Choose Your Own Adventure series, your journey soon becomes fraught with danger.'),(405,'User','A few months after the events in <a href=\"/Item/426\">Return of the Ninja</a>, you have returned to the United States and now live and practice martial arts in San Francisco. One day, a mysterious fellow student is kidnapped by gangsters, and you set out to rescue him from captivity.'),(407,'User','You are a smoke jumper (parachuting forestry firefighter) in training in the\nPacific Northwest of the USA. You hope to do your bit to fight fires and protect the\nenvironment.'),(408,'User','While visiting your Aunt and Uncle in northern California, you\r\nlose track of time while hiking the nearby Hawk Mountain.'),(409,'User','You are a young orphan living on a farm in Tang dynasty China. You must survive as nomadic raiders roam the rural areas.'),(410,'User','You go to Japan to compete in a nationwide karate competition, and must survive against gangsters and a corrupt corporation trying to take over the world.'),(413,'User','You and your sister Hannah live in Egypt during the school year while working on archaeological digs. In the summer, you visit your aunt Lydia in the Pacific Northwest. One summer, you discover a piece of a diary left by your father, who went missing several years ago. The diary refers to a sunken ship and the treasure it carried. Your Aunt Lydia tries to keep you and Hannah from investigating, but to no avail....'),(416,'User','You go to Korea to help find your missing friend Ling, who taught you Kung Fu in China last year.'),(418,'User','As punishment for bad behaviour, your parents send you over to spend the summer working in your uncle\'s pig farm in Ohio, where misfortune awaits.'),(420,'User','You are playing baseball with your friend Bruce in a vacant lot when you find a briefcase filled with over a million dollars, and no sign of whoever left it there....'),(424,'User','You\'re an orphan living with a mysterious uncle. One day your uncle is kidnapped, and you must solve the mystery behind his disappearance.'),(426,'User','In this direct sequel to <a href=\"/Item/490\">Secret of the Ninja</a>, it has been one year since you were able to save your friend Nada\'s dojo from an evil force. Now you have learned the art of ninjutsu yourself, and you soon find yourself and the dojo facing a new threat -- a mysterious ninja intruder.'),(427,'User','You learn you\'ve developed a gift that will let you excel at anything you try, and decide between trying your hand at sports, art or music.'),(430,'User','Your friend Billy has been studying kung fu. Although you haven\'t been studying it, you still get to travel to China with him on a class trip. When you get to China, though, Billy disappears!'),(431,'User','You are a young resident of planet Orca, an advanced and peaceful world where youth is rare; you soon learn the consequences of excessive curiosity.'),(432,'User','During a visit to a medieval-themed shop, you are given an opportunity to truly experience some of the adventure you have been reading about for so long....'),(433,'User','With your friend Sally, you have developed software to detect ancient ruins in satellite photos.  You hope that your latest results will lead you to the Lost City of Gold in Peru, but you must avoid jealous adversaries in order to reach the ruins safely.'),(434,'User','You have been kidnapped by an insane geneticist and turned into a hulking beast!'),(435,'User','While visiting your grandmother in Canada, you begin to suspect that the old mine your grandfather worked in before his death still contains some gold; since your grandmother is in debt, you decide to investigate.'),(436,'User','You are the descendent of a long-lost Arctic explorer, and when you hear that a movie is going to be made about his more famous and successful rival, you decide that it\'s time to find out what really happened all those years ago....'),(437,'User','You are a seeker of sunken treasures, but you are distracted from your normal activities when a girl asks you to help her find her lost father, a computer programmer who disappeared while searching for the source of some mysterious signals.'),(438,'User','Your parents have left you home alone, so you do the only logical thing you can think of: attempt to run off and join your uncle\'s archaeological expedition.'),(439,'Cover','This North-Eastern side has a distinctly French feel to it, mainly due to the skills of Fabien Deschamps, Henri Le Clerc and Pierre Pasqualle.<p>The French manager has also invested heavily in the best British talent, including England international Aaron Hall.  Can YOU help Tyne Athletic\'s expensively assembled squad live up to their promise to challenge for the title?'),(440,'Cover','Midlands side Trent Albion, for so long a sleeping giant, has muscled its way back to the top flight.  The squad features Italian, Danish, Portuguese, American and Dutch internationals.<p>Danish giant Heinrick Teller, their goalkeeper, is arguably the best in the world, whilst Massimo Landucci, Ruud Levenson and Paolo de Avila lead the attack in Trent\'s 4-3-3 formation.  Trent has assembled its best squad in years; can YOU help them regain past glories?'),(441,'Cover','Mersey City have a solid backbone of English talent with the Canwell brothers at the centre of their defence and the lightning speed of Joshua Sutherland up front, supported by the mercurial phenomenon that is Damien Pugh.<p>Great things are expected from this team with a rich background and history of success.  Is this the season when everything goes according to plan?  Can YOU steer Mersey City to cup and league glory?'),(442,'Cover','Carlos Delgado, 2003\'s Player of the Year, and pin-up Kieron Flynn lead the attack for the capital\'s biggest club.  Can YOU rely on the safe hands of Bob Brand to keep a clean sheet?<p>This is an exciting team with French, Spanish, Italian and English internationals playing a 4-4-2 formation.  Thames United is a frequent top five finisher, but glory still seems to elude them.  Can YOU get the best out of the Thames United squad?'),(443,'Cover','Bridgewater is Manchester\'s finest and the most mean defence in the league, opting for a 5-3-2 formation.  Scottish captain Duncan Stead is at the heart of the defence, ably supported by the young Italian international Enrico Broccardo as their sweeper.<p>This is a dangerous counterattacking team featuring Danish and Brazilian internationals and the emerging English talent Jak Bristol.  Will YOU be able to hit the opposition on the break with Bridgewater FC?'),(444,'Cover','Considered by many to be unfashionable, Medway United always confounded the critics.  With a Frenchman, a Jamaican, a Spaniard and a Scot, the backbone of the squad are solid, English pros.  Medway flood the midfield with a 4-5-1 formation.<p>Recent signing Junior McCafferty, the Jamaican international, promises exciting times ahead for the team.  YOU have the chance to quieten the critics by taking Medway United to the top!'),(445,'User','You are a solo scout for the Federation of Planets, and you have been assigned to restore stability on Utopa, a planet normally free from war and predation but currently in a state of crisis.'),(446,'User','You travel to Florida to help your neighbor\'s sister paint her houseboat, and soon you stumble upon an adventure....'),(447,'User','Three years after discovering Atlantis, you decide to go back and learn more about the lost city.'),(448,'User','During a vacation, you stumble upon a cave and find yourself transported back in time to ancient Greece, where you have an opportunity to participate in the early Olympic games.'),(449,'User','The Mona Lisa has been stolen, and the French authorities have asked you to help them find it.\r\n'),(450,'User','Ten years ago, the Earth was invaded by aliens who disabled all of the planet\'s electricity due to their own vulnerabilities. You have decided to somehow find a way to free the Earth\'s population and restore power to the world.'),(451,'User','Your lifepod has crashed on a planet that resembles Earth but which has rather more unusual inhabitants....'),(452,'User','The year is 1860, and you are visiting your uncle in the Wild West.'),(471,'User','This is a one-on-one adventure for a single player and a DM.'),(475,'User','This is a one-on-one adventure for a single player and a DM.'),(477,'User','This is a one-on-one adventure for a single player and a DM.'),(479,'User','This adventure is designed for four players and a DM.'),(481,'User','This adventure is designed for four players and a DM.'),(483,'User','This adventure is designed for four players and a DM.'),(484,'User','Dr. Wogan, a scientist working on an anti-radiation device to protect the world from nuclear war, has disappeared, and you, as his assistant, must somehow find him.'),(485,'User','You are a recent Elite-level graduate of the Space Academy, and your first mission involves a near-invincible alien vampire!'),(486,'User','You\'re the leader of a promising new band, but before you can enter stardom, you\'ll need to rescue two of your members from kidnappers.'),(487,'User','You travel to Mexico to help your aunt Eloisa find a legendary temple.'),(488,'User','You must save your village from the icy spell of an evil wizard.'),(489,'User','Your boring summer is enlivened somewhat by the involvement of a mermaid.'),(490,'User','Something mysterious and disturbing is happening in your friend Nada\'s dojo, and you have to help her figure out exactly what is wrong.'),(491,'User','For spring break, you\'re helping your uncle David out at his antique shop and exploring New Orleans during Mardi Gras.'),(492,'User','You are determined to find a legendary silver sword hidden in a Hawaiian volcano.'),(493,'User','While taking care of your eccentric great-aunt\'s house, you come upon a secret room in which she has prepared a surprise for you....'),(500,'User','By the year 2035, the United States has been split into three hostile provinces - Dorado, Rebellium, and Turtalia. You are a spy working for the Turtalian democracy and you must escape from the hostile Dorado.'),(502,'User','The year is 2041 (or 2051, if you read the reissue edition). As the Chief of Operations for Turtalia, you face two immediate problems: the disappearance of two valuable agents and the escape of a dangerous Doradan spy.'),(503,'User','You and your friends Tony and Andrea set off in search of another friend, Jill, who has vanished in the Bermuda Triangle.'),(504,'User','A sailing trip with your uncle takes a turn for the worse when your ship is wrecked and you find yourself involved with Omicron, an evil corporation bent on conquering the world.'),(505,'User','Your class visits the Statue of Liberty and this, as the title suggests, leads you to adventure!'),(506,'User','You have to find and recapture your escaped pet flying squirrel which you brought along on a trip to the Statue of Liberty on a dare.'),(507,'User','Both of your parents are physicists dabbling in antimatter experiments. One morning, you wake up, and all is quiet. Too quiet.'),(508,'User','You visit your aunt in England, where you learn first-hand about the secrets of the Fair Folk.'),(509,'User','The year is 938. You are about to set off on your first sea voyage when you see a man who you believe might be Odin, the Norse god who once gave your great-grandfather a magical trumpet....'),(510,'User','Your parents may have found evidence of the existence of Olympus, palace of the gods, but they\'ll lose their funding unless they can prove that their discovery is genuine. Your grandmother suggests that you ask Zeus for advice on getting proof, and you attempt to do just that....'),(511,'User','You go to visit your uncle, an author of adventure novels, at his home, an old ranger station in the woods. He\'s behaving rather oddly, however, and his latest book seems a little too close to reality for comfort....'),(512,'User','You travel to Thailand in hope of learning more about Jim Thompson, an American who worked in the silk business until his mysterious disappearance in 1967.'),(514,'User','While in Japan, you get involved in a search for a stolen tea bowl which also happens to be a Japanese national treasure.'),(515,'User','You are the private investigator who solved the Harlowe Thrombey murder case, but you\'re growing bored with your profession. It\'s time for something new: ghost hunting!'),(516,'User','A rich man call you and asks for help when he feels his life is in danger... Eventually (as the title gives away), you find yourself trying to solve a murder case.'),(517,'User','It is 1507, and your village\'s water supply has become tainted. You must find a way to purify it, perhaps with the help of a unicorn, before it is too late!'),(518,'LC','In this interactive adventure book, the reader enters a mysterious cave and becomes lost in time, experiencing different eras of the past or future depending on which path is chosen.'),(518,'User','You wander into a cave which transports you randomly through time, leading to all manner of adventures.'),(520,'User','You return to the Cave of Time and end up in medieval Europe, where you must solve a riddle and find a mysterious castle.'),(521,'LC','The reader once again enters the mysterious Cave of Time and by following the instructions on each page can have several different adventures backward and forward in time.'),(521,'User','You travel back to the Cave of Time and see what fate has in store for you....'),(522,'User','You decide to join the American Revolution, and you are given a mission to deliver an important message to George Washington.'),(523,'User','You are a secret agent during World War II, and you must rescue two of your friends from a Nazi-held castle.'),(524,'User','While stuck in a miserable summer camp, you wander across a fairy ring and get transported to England in the middle ages, where you encounter characters from the Robin Hood legend.'),(525,'User','As an agent for the Special Security Agency, you must track down a man named Dimitrius, who has become dangerous and powerful as the result of Russian experiments.'),(526,'User','Your hike through Nepal leads you into a forbidden temple. As punishment for your intrusion, you must survive in the forms of several different animals in order to earn your freedom.'),(527,'User','You\'ve been hired by a rancher to find some of his horses which have disappeared into the Grand Canyon under mysterious circumstances.'),(528,'User','You get to spend winter vacation helping your Aunt Sadie with her ski lodge. Of course, all is not well there....'),(529,'User','You\'re a photographer working in the field on an article about rare gorillas for <i>African Naturalist</i> magazine.'),(530,'User','You\'ve won a computer programming contest, and the prize is an extremely advanced computer....'),(531,'User','Dr. Vivaldi has discovered a bottomless crevasse and disappeared into it... You are part of an expedition sent to find out exactly where it leads.'),(532,'User','Professor Zinka, your new neighbor, is experimenting with hyperspace... You get involved in the strange results of his experiments.'),(533,'User','Dr. Vivaldi asks you to accompany her on a search for the Arkasaur, a dinosaur which may have recently been sighted in the ocean.'),(534,'User','In this sequel to <a href=\"/Item/535\">Prisoner of the Ant People</a>, you and Flppto the Martian are working with the Lacoonian System Rapid Force and must defeat the Evil Power Master before he destroys three entire planets.'),(535,'User','You are a member of the Zondo Quest Group II, a research organization dedicated to battling a mysterious and destructive entity called the Evil Power Master.'),(536,'User','You\'ve just finished studying the art of private detection, and your first case is to prove that levitation is possible.'),(537,'User','You are a young reporter assigned to write about a group of teenagers investigating the history of Stonehenge.'),(538,'User','You are summoned by your aunt to Scotland, where you must help resolve a family crisis.'),(539,'User','You are a wandering adventurer in search of treasure in a time of wizards and dragons.'),(540,'User','With the help of some friends, you search for centuries-old sunken treasure in waters supposedly inhabited by modern-day pirates.'),(541,'User','You travel to the vampire-infested Carpathian Mountains of Romania to help your uncle Andrew prove scientifically that the undead actually exist.'),(542,'User','You travel from America to England to visit your cousin Amanda, who lives in the cursed Batterslea Hall.'),(543,'User','You and your psychic brother Ned investigate the disappearance of all of Earth\'s oil.'),(544,'User','Your small plane crashes in the Canadian Rockies and its pilot is too badly hurt to move, so you must search for help in the dangerous terrain all by yourself.'),(545,'User','While on vacation with your friends Ricardo and Lisa, you encounter ghosts in a town with a dark past.'),(546,'User','You are an amateur detective and psychic investigator. After receiving a mysterious phone call, you end up investigating a modern house built on the site of an old prison.'),(547,'User','Because of your ESP abilities, the government asks you to help them find out why ships have been disappearing at sea.'),(548,'User','You are a doctor trying to help various tribes living near the Amazon battle tropical diseases. Unfortunately, your expedition disappears before you can do anything, and you have to find and rescue them.'),(549,'User','You travel to New Zealand with your uncle Charlie in search of the Lost Tribe of Fiordland.'),(550,'User','As the title suggests, you are the commander of a space patrol and you must travel through the solar system making sure all is in order.'),(551,'User','You travel to Egypt with your uncle Bruce, a professor who believes that the largest pyramid at Giza can be used as an energy source.'),(552,'User','You have been chosen to compete in two races in Africa, a speed race and a rough road race.'),(553,'LC','You are an expert mountain climber and embark on an expedition in the Himalayas to find the Yeti and rescue a fellow climber. By choosing the specific pages, you determine the outcome.'),(553,'User','You are a mountain climber. With your friend Carlos you travel to Nepal in search of the Yeti.'),(554,'User','You are kidnapped by the U-TY masters, alien creatures who wish to place you in a zoo.'),(555,'LC','You face deadly dangers as a writer on assignment in Mexico to explore the ruins of the Mayan Indians and solve the mystery of why the ancient civilization collapsed. By choosing specific pages, you determine the outcome.'),(555,'User','You are assigned to discover the reason for the end of the ancient Mayan civilization.'),(556,'LC','Jewels have disappeared from a museum show in Paris. Can you find them? By choosing specific pages, you determine the outcome.'),(556,'User','Your cousins Peter and Lucy ask for your help in finding the magical jewels of Nabooti.'),(560,'User','As an agent of the Special Intelligence Group, you must fight Russian spies and discover the secret of a mysterious new whale song.'),(561,'User','While visiting your cousins Michael and Jane in Connecticut, you end up exploring a supposedly cursed house which is said to be occupied only by the cat of a dead woman.'),(562,'LC','The reader\'s decisions control a series of adventures in outer space, beginning on a spaceship traveling between galaxies.'),(562,'User','You are born on a spaceship to parents from two different planets and must choose one of two possible homeworlds. Various adventures occur on the way to (or on) the homeworld you decide to visit.'),(563,'User','You travel from France to Africa in a balloon, accompanied by your friends Peter and Sarah and a dog named Harry.'),(565,'User','This set was released both with the original versions of the books and with the 1989/1990 retitled reissues.'),(569,'User','You visit your aunt and uncle, both circus people, and are given the choice to learn to be an acrobat, a clown, or an animal trainer.'),(570,'User','Your dog runs into a haunted house and you must find him.'),(571,'LC','The reader is asked to make choices which will determine the outcome of a search for sunken treasure.'),(572,'LC','The reader is asked to make choices which will determine the fate of a discarded robot.'),(573,'LC','The reader is given choices to make which determine the outcome of an adventure with a space monster who arrives in Cape Cod.'),(574,'LC','The reader is given choices to make in order to fight the green slime made from a chemistry set.'),(575,'User','You and your dog discover a bottle of shrinking potion, and predictably bad things occur as a result.'),(576,'User','Your village needs rain, so you head off in search of the kachinas, spirits who may be able to help you.'),(577,'User','You go to sleep and have dreams. Hmm.'),(578,'User','You find a genie in a bottle and, predictably enough, get some wishes granted.'),(579,'User','While you\'re camping in the woods your campsite is attacked by something that leaves behind huge footprints.'),(580,'User','You and your best friend somehow manage to catch a humanoid lake monster while fishing.'),(581,'User','You go on safari with your uncle Stanley and his daughter, your favorite cousin June. During your journey you hope to find a Kawamba, a rare species of ape not seen in many years.'),(582,'User','While vacationing in Vermont, you and your sister Mag decide to search for Champ, the monster said to live in Lake Champlain.'),(583,'User','Your aunt Louise gives you a charm which will grant you three wishes....'),(584,'User','An avalanche traps you in a cave where living Ice Age creatures are frozen in the walls.'),(585,'User','You search for dragon\'s gold in hope of helping out your poor family.'),(586,'User','Your horse, Ginger, has disappeared, and now you have to figure out where she went!'),(587,'User','For the first time ever, you head off to summer camp on your own!'),(588,'User','During a trip to England, you pay a midnight visit to the infamous Tower of London with your ghost-obsessed penpal Rodney.'),(589,'User','You are the son of a pair of space rescue workers. While your parents are away an emergency call comes in and you decide to follow it with the help of your alien friend Xmax.'),(590,'User','You live in Egypt. When Mona, your pet camel, escapes, you must bring her back before your parents find out or they will sell her.'),(591,'User','Minotuk, an Inuit friend of yours, invites you to visit him in the far north.'),(592,'User','Your aunt Dottie takes you to Egypt to search for a magical scarab necklace in a mummy\'s tomb.'),(593,'User','As it turns out, the Persian carpet your aunt gave you can fly! You accidentally activate it and get transported to a world of Arabian fairy tales.'),(594,'User','While biking with friends, you find a sign in the middle of the woods which somehow transports you through time.'),(595,'User','Your house catches on fire while you\'re home alone and you have to do something about it.'),(596,'User','The princess of your fairy tribe has been kidnapped, and you must help rescue her!'),(597,'User','Thanks to your cousin Sally you get trapped in a spaceship headed towards Mars.'),(598,'User','After being left outside as punishment for destroying a shoe, your dog disappears. You, of course, set off to find him.'),(599,'User','On the way to your grandparents\' house, the bus you are riding has an accident in a sudden blizzard, and you are stranded with your little brother at a spooky old inn.'),(600,'User','While on vacation in Antigua you hear the story of the ghost of English Harbor and get dared to look for it in a cemetery.'),(601,'User','In order to compete with your younger sister\'s exceptional gardening skills, you purchase some fertilizer from a weird old man.  Alas, it is a bit more effective than you had ever imagined....'),(602,'User','A magical owl-inhabited tree in the woods leads you to various adventures.'),(603,'User','You accidentally go to the wrong Halloween party - one full of real ghosts and goblins.'),(604,'User','Your sand-castle building is interrupted for dinner, and a storm is coming....'),(605,'User','The year is 1696, and you are a Tibetan child eager to join a caravan to India.'),(606,'User','On Easter, you follow a talking bunny and somehow travel through time in the process'),(607,'User','Your aunt, a stunt woman, takes you on location with her as she works on a new movie.'),(608,'User','While on vacation in Arizona, you notice a mysterious light at the top of a nearby mountain....'),(609,'User','You fall while putting a star on a Christmas tree, then find yourself pulled back in time to 19th century England.'),(610,'User','After getting hit in the head with a softball, you find that you can see into the future.'),(611,'User','After a mishap with a chemistry set, you visit a store, have a run-in with its cruel owner, and possibly end up in a weird world inhabited by sentient toothpaste tubes.'),(612,'User','You travel to Wyoming to witness a fossil hunt headed by a paleontologist named Dr. Robert Holmes.'),(613,'User','You have just moved into an old (possibly haunted) house in Plymouth, Massachusetts, and it\'s nearly Thanksgiving.'),(614,'User','While cleaning the attic with your friend Robert you come across a magical cape of invisibility.'),(615,'User','You have been asked to watch your uncle Bill\'s horse, Straight Shooter, to be sure that nothing happens to him before he is entered in the Kentucky Derby.'),(616,'User','After being swept off a luxury liner by a huge wave, you find yourself on an island from which you must be rescued.'),(617,'User','A celebration of Martin Luther King, Jr.\'s birthday leads you to have dreams about him and his impact on the world.'),(618,'User','Your summer with your grandparents becomes considerably less dull when you explore their attic and find a mysterious old chest....'),(619,'User','While covering the Tour De France, a French bike race, you begin to think there is a conspiracy to prevent one of the contestants from winning.'),(620,'User','A British woman approaches you and asks you to search for some letters hidden in India by one of her ancestors around the time of the Kanpur Massacre.'),(621,'User','While covering a rock star\'s tour, you discover that her life is in danger.'),(622,'User','Your team goes along with a group of reenactors following a path originally taken during the Crusades, but you quickly get sidetracked....'),(623,'User','Your assignment to travel on the Trans-Siberian Express is made more interesting by the presence of Dr. Yuri Karamatzov, an artificial intelligence expert....'),(624,'User','While covering the Cannes Film Festival, you see a short movie inviting its audience to search for its creator in order to win five million dollars.'),(625,'User','Many years after your grandfather was executed for treachery during World War II, one of his associates has returned to offer you a part in resurrecting Hitler\'s ambitions for world domination.  Being alarmingly poor, you seriously consider the offer....'),(626,'User','You must prove your worth to join the elite Space Hawks squadron, then help a race of ape-like aliens defend themselves against gigantic space locusts.'),(627,'User','You and the other Space Hawks must find a way to stop the Cephids, enormous insect-like creatures, before they can consume the Earth.'),(628,'User','The Space Hawks are assigned to investigate a strange structure.'),(632,'User','You volunteer to go into suspended animation for a thousand years. When you awaken in the year 3000, you find that the entire solar system is under the control of an evil tyrant named Styx Mori.'),(633,'User','Your three older brothers are adventurers. On your thirteenth birthday, each of them offers to take you on an adventure. You can go to Hong Kong to search for two missing Americans, you can search for a lost caravan in the Takla Makan Desert, or you can attempt to find valuable missing documents in the Himalayas.'),(634,'User','You must either prevent the evil Queen from finding and capturing Snow White, or lead the Prince to her sleeping place so he can wake her up.'),(635,'LC','The reader shares the adventures of the famous puppet and decides their outcome.'),(635,'User','One day you visit Geppetto the carpenter and learn about the existence of Pinocchio. Out of curiosity, you set out in search of him and get the chance to join in his adventures. '),(637,'LC','The reader becomes involved with Cinderella, but must make choices which will determine if she marries a Prince or not.'),(638,'User','While in a dream you see Alice running in pursuit of the White Rabbit and decide to follow her, eventually stumbling into Wonderland.'),(654,'User','While on summer vacation you encounter a murderous werewolf.'),(655,'User','A visit to an archaeological site leads you to supernatural danger and the promise of hidden treasure.'),(656,'User','During a vacation, you and your sister get lost on an island supposedly haunted by the ghosts of a tribe of cannibals.'),(657,'User','You and your friends Josh and Megan win a trip to a castle in England and, of course, learn that it\'s haunted.'),(659,'User','Your lucky hat is stolen shortly before you plan to enter a tournament for players of Worm Wars, a pinball-like game.'),(660,'LC','The reader\'s decisions control the course of an adventure involving an ancient mask from the Amazon rain forest that can change people into flies.'),(662,'User','You must return an ancient Egyptian amulet which your friend Josh found in his pocket after visiting a museum before you get in trouble for possessing it.'),(665,'LC','The reader\'s decisions control the course of an adventure in the woods involving spooky ghost kids, disappearing parents, underground goblins, and mind-blowing time warps.'),(666,'User','You are called on to babysit for a 2-year-old girl named Katie. She behaves strangely.'),(667,'LC','The reader makes choices that control the outcome of a visit from pen pal Billy, who is not the way he seemed in his letters.'),(668,'User','After a visit to a carnival\'s hall of mirrors which somehow rearranges your face, you must deal with life as a freak!'),(672,'User','Helping Luke Skywalker look for a lost droid in the desert leads you right into the plot of the first <i>Star Wars</i> movie.'),(673,'User','After surviving a while on the ice planet Hoth you have an opportunity to continue your Jedi education with Yoda....'),(674,'User','You must help rescue Han Solo then survive various events leading up to the final confrontation with the Emperor.'),(676,'User','In the world of Piers Anthony\'s <i>Bio of a Space Tyrant</i>, you play Commander Emerald Sheller on a mission to outflank a pirate fleet hiding in the asteroid belt. If you cannot reach your attack position in less than twelve hours, the Jupiter fleet will lose.'),(692,'User','You must travel to the distant city of Athens from Troezen in order to prove that you are King Aegeus\' son, and after that, reach the island of Crete in order to avenge your brother Theseus\' death.'),(693,'User','Having reached the island of Crete, you must find a way to enter the Labyrinth and slay the Minotaur in order to rid Athens of its scourge. Though not essential, you might also want to learn the purpose of the numbered squares at the beginning of the book (a secret that has deprived many players of several nights of sleep).'),(694,'User','Having slain the Minotaur and fled Crete, you embark on a difficult journey back to your homeland.'),(709,'User','You must collect as many time crystals as possible by solving puzzles while travelling through four different time zones.'),(727,'LC','The reader makes choices about the unfolding of Moses\'s life.'),(749,'User','This rather outdated (but still interesting) reference book explains the workings of various types of role-playing games.'),(750,'User','You must travel into an underground complex and retrieve a valuable golden dragon. There are two catches, however.... First, you can\'t touch the dragon unless you find its gemstone eyes. Second, you will die from a slow-acting poison unless you retrieve the item within two weeks and exchange some of the money you get from selling it for an antidote.'),(770,'LC','As a young Jewish immigrant from Bavaria in the mid-nineteenth century, the reader makes decisions that mirror the choices made by new Jewish Americans as they settled in the United States.'),(772,'LC','The reader\'s decisions control the course of the action as various Jewish characters in eastern Europe at the turn of the twentieth century decide where their lives will take them.'),(773,'LC','As a young Jewish survivor of the Holocaust in Poland who emigrates to Palestine in 1945 and lives in the new state of Israel, the reader makes choices which affect his family, his residence, his career, his country, and his sense of identity as a Jew.'),(783,'User','Your high-level <a href=\"/Series/20\">AD&D</a> character encounters something altogether new....'),(785,'User','This introductory adventure promotes the <a href=\"/Category/89\">Alternity</a> role-playing game.'),(787,'User','In this demo for the <b>Marvel Super Heroes Adventure Game</b>, Wolverine battles an evil alien monster.'),(789,'User','A mysterious informant sends you to investigate a highly secured area.'),(792,'User','The daughter of a general, you are currently on a trip through the Wastes, building your fighting skills so that you can compete in the Warrior Games. Alas, things go downhill for you quickly....'),(793,'User','You are a young shepherd, and your boring life is enlivened a bit when your grazing trip leads you to a crystal-filled tunnel leading deep into the realm of the dwarf king.'),(794,'User','While hiding in the palace in an effort to acquire some of the prince\'s hair for a love charm, you overhear dire news from the king and determine to do what you can to save the kingdom from the evil Blackthorn.'),(795,'User','You are a young bard about to meet the king of the court in which you have been sent to work. Alas, all is not well in the kingdom, and you will soon need to use your skills for more than entertainment....'),(796,'User','Although your current occupation involves washing dishes, you are an ambitious weaver and hope to someday be rich. For the moment, though, you\'ll be happy to catch a glimpse of the unicorn that is predicted to determine a new ruler for your currently kingless land....'),(797,'User','While gathering firewood, you accidentally unearth a cursed staff, and must find a way to break its influence before you home faces ruin.'),(801,'User','On a dare, friends Mikel and Dar venture into the haunted ruins of the Gargoyle King\'s castle.'),(802,'User','Young Jessica sets out to prove women can be just as strong as men by stringing her legendary ancestor\'s bow, but she gets a little more than she bargained for when she finds herself responsible for stopping an invading frost giant and fire demon.'),(805,'User','A young page on your way to the Crusades, you are swept overboard in rough seas. Trying to save yourself, you grab the first thing within reach -- an Ankh, mysterious symbol of power in ancient Egypt -- and suddenly you find yourself whirling through time and space, bound for the land and the age of the Pharaohs.'),(806,'User','A pair of friends decide to leave their dull lives behind and go on a Quest to find their True Loves.'),(815,'User','You come across the soul of a djinni who was trapped into two rings by an evil, now dead sorcerer. He asks you to journey to the sorcerer\'s palace in order to free his spirit.'),(817,'User','A powerful mage offers you a reward if you can find a magical scepter located inside a deserted temple.'),(819,'User','A beggar sells you a map showing the location of a priceless gem in a mountain range inhabited by a group of frost giants.'),(827,'User','The reissue has the original passages in invisible ink filled in.'),(832,'User','You are Bobby Barbarian. When your friends are captured by the evil Venger, you must use all your courage to rescue them from the Tower of Midnight Dreams.'),(833,'User','The reader controls Presto, the bumbling magician. While trying to conjure up some magic to escape a monster, he and Eric are sent to a place where his already unreliable magic is reversed.'),(834,'User','Tiamat the dragon is destroying the Golden Forest. As Sheila the Thief, you must recover a spell book which contains a spell capable of defeating her.'),(835,'User','As Michael, Eric\'s younger brother, you find yourself trapped in the same strange land as your sibling.  You must help him escape from a maze set up by the evil Venger.'),(836,'User','You are Hank Ranger. You must help a strange blue creature named Folderol discover a new ruler for the kingdom of Aknar before Venger can conquer it.'),(837,'User','You are Diana Acrobat. You must rescue your friends from the Shrieker, an evil pixie harnessing the energy of the stars.'),(841,'User','The evil sorcerer Kelek has stolen a magical power that keeps the world of Dungeons and Dragons separate from the real world. Evil creatures from the D & D world will invade and destroy the real world, unless you can find three pieces of a magical crystal. Along the way you will have to face the evil wizard Venger and the mighty dragon Tiamat, as well as other minions.'),(849,'LC','As an Earth Inspector, the reader travels back in time to Greece in 400 B.C. to search out the Oracle of Delphi and discover the secret of her powers.'),(850,'LC','As an Earth Inspector, the reader is called upon to save a friend lying near death after returning from the Amazon.'),(851,'LC','As an Earth Inspector sent to find the real meaning of an Aboriginal legend, the reader travels back 200 years in time and is drawn into the conflicts between the white settlers and the native Australians.'),(852,'LC','The reader is called upon to find and rescue Zy, a fellow Earth Inspector, who has been captured and brought before \"The Three,\" the most dangerous personages in Venice.'),(853,'LC','As an Earth Inspector, the reader tries to find the strange place where elephants live underground.'),(854,'LC','As an Earth Inspector, the reader tries to solve the riddle of the army made of clay.'),(855,'User','In order to discover why no Europeans followed Marco Polo\'s route to China for three hundred years, you must travel back in time and follow the route yourself.'),(856,'LC','As an Earth Inspector, the reader tries to uncover the mystery of the great American invention.'),(858,'LC','As an Earth Inspector trying to solve a riddle, the reader encounters ancient samurai warriors, copes with strange customs, and gets lost on Mt. Fuji.'),(870,'User','You\'ve just started a new job at Timeron Engineering Solutions, and it turns out that the company isn\'t quite what you originally thought... (and yes, in the long run, this does have something to do with <i>Earth 2</i>).'),(871,'User','Something is hurting the Terrians, and with the help of the rest of the Eden Advance, you must find and assemble an ancient artifact in order to save the world.'),(887,'User','You and a telepathic wolf find yourselves whisked off to another world overrun by undead.'),(891,'User','You and your companions have just escaped the wizard Teraptus, but the journey home may not be as simple as you thought.'),(899,'User','You are Caric, a fighter. An annoying halfling thief leads you to a dungeon containing \"all the treasure in the world.\" In this dungeon, you battle various nasties in an attempt to get rich quick.'),(900,'User','You are Landon, an elf sent to discover why vital supply caravans have been disappearing before reaching your isolated village. You end up exploring Shanafria, a frozen mountain with some decidedly unfriendly inhabitants.'),(901,'User','You are Jaimie, a villager with the ability to speak with animals. You and your animal friends Fox and Owl assist a party of adventurers in exploring the ruins of Castle Pentegarn.'),(903,'User','Rebellious dwarves separate you from your parents, forcing you to attempt to survive on your own and perhaps dabble in politics.'),(904,'User','In this sequel to <a href=\"/Item/901\">Pillars of Pentegarn</a>, you and Pentegarn are charged with practicing magic without a license. As a result, you must travel to Rainbow Castle and face three evil wizards.'),(905,'User','The son of a secret agent is given some irradiated diamonds and gets involved in a conspiracy.'),(906,'User','You are Kyiki, the son of an important Universal Minerals executive. An accident leaves you stranded on the surface of Volturnus, a planet not yet inhabited by humans.'),(907,'User','You are Terry Morton, a young electronics expert. While on your way to show your robot to your friend, you spot some suspicious activity at your father\'s electronics plant and decide to investigate.'),(908,'User','You are Laela, a young orphan girl. One night, you and your friend Petra free a Pegasus from an evil circus owner and learn of a conspiracy to rule Greyhawk. Soon you are captured and forced to work in the circus.'),(909,'User','You are Omina, the stepchild of the Wizard of Eternal Spring. When your ailing stepfather is captured by the Winter Wizard, you must find a cure for his illness and rescue him.'),(910,'User','You are Ren. With two of your friends, you set off on a coming-of-age quest to discover the source of the mysterious lights atop a mountain near your village.'),(911,'User','You are Morgan, a young magic user. When you and your pseudo-dragon companion are sent to release your uncle from a 900-year exile, you discover that he plots to destroy the world with the help of an ancient dragon.'),(912,'User','You are Kyol, a human orphan raised by Elves. When a great Elven leader is captured, you have an opportunity to prove your worth.'),(913,'User','You are Treon, a young prince sent far away from your besieged kingdom for your own protection. You believe strongly, however, that the best way to save your home would be to summon a dragon....'),(914,'User','The land of Oon is guarded by a gold dragon. The dragon, reasonably enough, expects payment for his service. You, a cleric named Loendal, are the latest adventurer chosen to find treasure for the dragon.'),(915,'User','While away at school you have difficulty communicating with your parents at home; something terrible is going on and you must investigate.'),(916,'User','A dying man gives you and your brother a mission - the two of you must find a cave containing the bones of a king and put them to rest. If you can accomplish this, you\'ll receive a considerable amount of treasure!'),(917,'User','A mortally wounded knight charges you and your friend to a death quest, forcing you to carry a warning to the city of Galparan before it is attacked by rebel Bossonian March Riders.'),(918,'User','You protect an old beggar from attack and he tells your future in return -- you are destined to have a night of adventure.'),(919,'User','You are Rand, a young fighting monk. You are asked to help prevent a war between two kingdoms in order to put your abilities to use outside the temple and gain the experience you need to act as a master.'),(920,'User','You are an orphan visiting a town with the gypsies who have raised you. During your visit, you learn about your past and get involved in an important mission.'),(921,'User','You are a young samurai sent by your emperor of Nippon to retrieve the three magical items that your now missing father searched for years ago.'),(922,'User','You are Merrill, a human exchange student living on the distant world of Artule while your father works on establishing a trade agreement. During your time on Artule you must deal with prejudice and investigate a conspiracy.'),(923,'User','Having escaped from slavery you must flee from the minions of the evil witch responsible for your former fate.'),(924,'User','You wander the jungle in search of the people responsible for the abduction of some of your followers.'),(925,'User','You must recover your father\'s stolen spell book from a lich which has taken up residence in Castle Necropolis, an evil place near your home.'),(926,'User','Your sister is badly injured in an explosion and you must find a way to heal her... Unfortunately, good healing is hard to find in your post-apocalyptic world.'),(927,'User','While attempting to impress a new friend, you find yourself entering the ruined tower that your mother disappeared in two years ago.'),(928,'User','You are Davin Farold, a mercenary travelling home to prove your worth to a father who disapproves of your profession. Unfortunately, a decidedly purposeful storm gets in the way of all this, leaving you to a dangerous mission.'),(929,'User','As Tarzan, you come across a plane wreck while trying to rescue a lioness from poachers. Eventually, your explorations lead you to something bigger and more exciting....'),(930,'User','You are Redmond Longbow, and you have taken up a career of thievery in order to free your people from an invading king\'s army. Just recently, however, you and your friends have been captured....'),(931,'User','As a young cavalier, you must face the conspiracy behind a series of orc raids in your kingdom.'),(932,'User','You are Toby, the son of a settler. Your frontier village has lately been under frequent attack by dragons, and while out collecting scales, you begin to learn why....'),(933,'User','You\'re a half-elf cleric who often has visions. Your latest one alerts you to a threat to your home and forces you to go on a dangerous quest to prove your manhood.'),(934,'User','As a young bard-wannabe, you must help release Liliel, queen of the faerie folk, from a trap set by a corrupt and powerful druid.'),(938,'User','You are Garik, a young magician unexpectedly given the mission of defeating an evil king with a magic crystal.'),(939,'User','You are Thomas Blackfoot, a book-loving halfling who also happens to be known as the Black Shadow, a famous thief. Your friend Clarion the pegasus has been kidnapped by your arch-enemy, the Blue Hag, and you must rescue her with the help of two of your diminutive friends.'),(940,'User','The year is 2085 and you are the youngest astronaut on Mars. While exploring, you come across the ruins of an ancient civilization and discover that the entire human race is in danger.'),(941,'User','Your entire village has been turned into lizards by a shapeshifting witch and you must restore them with the help of a rather inept cleric.'),(950,'User','You are the only survivor of an unfortunate encounter between a spaceship and a meteor. Your lifepod lands on the dangerous planet of Tenopia, and you must find a way home.'),(951,'User','On your way to Kabran, you fall from a balloon, get implanted with gills and find yourself in need of a way out of the dangerous Sea Kingdom.'),(952,'User','At last you\'ve reached Kabran... but now you need to figure out where the Galactic Patrol Station that holds the key to your freedom is actually located!'),(953,'User','Life is never easy. Just as you think you\'re on your way home, space pirates attack your ship and force you to track down an alternate means of transport: the well-hidden emergency Galactic Patrol starship.'),(954,'User','In search of adventure, you have decided to explore the dangerous Kingdom of Frome.  No sooner have you set foot in the land than you are imprisoned in the royal castle.  Can you escape imprisonment and find a way out of the castle?'),(955,'User','Having escaped from the King\'s castle, you find yourself exploring the kingdom of Frome.  The entire realm is surrounded by a venomous bush, so you\'ll have to find a secret path to cross its borders.  Can you find the three secret spells which will lead you to freedom?'),(956,'User','You have made it through the forests of Frome and now must journey through the six levels of the Caverns of Mornas, find the mysterious master trader, and convince him or her to show you the way which leads out of the Caverns toward home.  Things are further complicated when you find out the tyrant\'s soldiers are exploring the caverns in search of you.'),(957,'User','Having escaped the caverns of Mornas, you find yourself in the mountain range that separates Frome from your homeland.  Finding a way through it will not be easy, especially when it has become the scene of a three-sided war, where the participants are the tyrant\'s army, the rebel forces and an army raised by an evil rogue general.  In order to escape, you\'ll first have to help the rebellion triumph and make Frome a free land again.'),(960,'User','You are assigned to help two scientists learn more about the subatomic realm. To accomplish this, you must shrink to an incredibly small size and see a quark.'),(961,'User','A global plague can only be cured by one scientist\'s formula, and a brain injury prevents him from remembering it. You must shrink, find the damaged area of the man\'s brain and stimulate the memory.'),(962,'User','A box containing the formula for a new shark repellent is stolen - by a shark! You must retrieve it.'),(963,'User','You must explore the moons of Jupiter to find if there are enough natural resources on them to support Earth when its own supplies run dry.'),(977,'User','One of the five TIME Lords has betrayed the interplanetary alliance and is travelling back in time, trying to change Earth’s history to give his or her race hegemony over other races. You must find out who the Renegade Lord is and stop him or her before the universe as you know it is changed forever.'),(989,'LC','While vacationing in Scotland, the reader becomes involved in searching for a missing professor who has been investigating the Loch Ness monster and is provided with some fantastic choices to make.'),(990,'LC','The reader\'s decisions control a series of adventures inside a museum, including time travel to ancient Egypt and an encounter with aliens from the Alpha Centauri system.'),(991,'LC','You are shipwrecked on a beautiful Pacific island in 1869 and must choose a course of events that will get you off, keep you there, or, indeed, ensure that you survive at all.'),(992,'LC','In the role of a sailor gone three years from home, the reader is asked by a mysterious stranger to return to help his/her parents, then chooses the turns in a plot full of monstrous adventures.'),(995,'User','For the American editions, this book was split into two volumes, the first with a new title and the second with the original British title.'),(1007,'User','You wander into the forest behind your house, determined to prove that it is magical.'),(1008,'User','You are the weapons caretaker for a group of adventurers on a mission to defeat an evil skeleton king named Nightshade.'),(1009,'User','You and a halfling travel to Shadowcastle, an evil place created by Nightshade, to rescue innocent captives.'),(1010,'User','Once again, the Good Knight Gregor is battling Nightshade. This time the fight takes place in the Keep of the Ancient King, where Nightshade and his agent the Shadow Rider reside (and hold your horse captive).'),(1011,'User','You are the only person to escape capture when Nightshade\'s troops and the Shadow Rider attack your village. You must help Gregor the Good Knight rescue your fellow villagers.'),(1012,'User','On your way to a Star Rangers meeting you see a suspicious man entering the X-302 spaceship, an experimental project that your father has been working on, so you decide to investigate....'),(1013,'User','A mysterious voice in your attic leads you to adventure in a world of fantasy.'),(1014,'User','As a reward for stopping a spy, you and the other Space Rangers are given a tour of the SOLAR Star Station. Unfortunately, an insane robot is lurking in the area, ready to make your lives difficult.'),(1029,'User','You\'re an adventurer in search of fame and fortune, and you feel that the best way to achieve this is to rescue the kidnapped Lady Arowen from her evil captors.'),(1033,'User','This is rather familiar -- you head into Firetop Mountain in search of glory and treasure.'),(1034,'User','This brief article discusses the role-playing origins of <a href=\"/Series/11\">Fighting Fantasy</a>.'),(1035,'User','This two-page spread shows a map of Allansia along with descriptions of the first six <a href=\"/Series/11\">Fighting Fantasy</a> gamebooks that take place there.'),(1036,'User','This article features descriptions and stats for four <a href=\"/Series/11\">Fighting Fantasy</a> monsters: Sentinel, Bird Man, Messenger of Death and Earth Demon.  It also includes information on a monster-designing competition.'),(1037,'User','This article offers tips on gamebook mapping and includes a blank sheet of graph paper.'),(1038,'User','This article describes the rules of a competition to write a 200-section <a href=\"/Series/11\">Fighting Fantasy</a> adventure.'),(1040,'User','This quick editorial introduces the magazine and <a href=\"/Series/11\">Fighting Fantasy</a> in general.'),(1041,'User','This editorial introduces the issue\'s adventures, praises the entries in the previous issue\'s competition and offers a glimpse of things to come.'),(1042,'User','This article features a random encounter table of one hundred monsters drawn from early <a href=\"/Series/11\">Fighting Fantasy</a> and <a href=\"/Series/15\">Sorcery!</a> titles.  Special additional tables offer encounters specific to different types of areas: dungeons, castles, wilderness and water.'),(1043,'User','This article offers a biography of artist <a href=\"/Person/33\">Peter Andrew Jones</a>.'),(1044,'User','This post-holocaust short story is designed as a preview of <a href=\"/Item/50\">Freeway Fighter</a>.'),(1047,'User','This article is a request for humorous cartoon submissions.'),(1051,'User','While travelling through a desert you find a parchment with a message telling you about a priceless diamond hidden in a cave. You set off to find the stone.'),(1063,'User','A slightly revised and re-edited version appeared in the Fighting Fantasy 10th Anniversary Yearbook in 1992.'),(1065,'User','Sequel to The Floating City.'),(1067,'User','Sequel to Appointment with F.E.A.R.'),(1076,'User','Your father, Dr. Roger Ballantyne, has found what appears to be a map to the long-lost treasure of Sheba. He\'s kidnapped by the Fascists to aid their war effort. You must travel with Indiana Jones to Ethiopia to rescue him (and find the treasure!)'),(1077,'User','After discovering a race of mountain-dwelling giants in the Himalayas, a man has gone missing. You join Indiana Jones in an expedition to locate and rescue him.'),(1078,'User','While on on an expedition in Greece, Indiana Jones discovers a piece of the shield of Perseus, which is inscribed with the location of the legendary Eye of the Fates. This mystical item gives the holder the power to see the future-- and change it. Can you and Indiana Jones track it down before it falls into the wrong hands?'),(1081,'User','While visiting your cousin Indiana Jones for the summer, you receive word that two mummies have been stolen from the national museum. You accompany Indiana as he travels to Egypt to try and recover them.'),(1092,'User','You\'ve recently received a mysterious box from Sarah Jane Smith, and soon you\'re involved in an adventure to rescue the Doctor from Omega with the help of K-9 and Drax....'),(1093,'User','You must help the Doctor, Peri and Turlough defeat the evil Garth Hadeez, a maniac determined to destroy the solar system with the help of a black hole.'),(1094,'User','You\'re a refugee on Gallifrey in a time of crisis, and the Doctor needs your help due to your unusual telepathic powers.'),(1095,'User','The TARDIS materializes inside a spaceship, and you, Peri and the Doctor find yourselves surrounded by jars containing ominous and all-too-mobile plants....'),(1096,'User','A dimensional accident lands you in the TARDIS, where you end up helping the Doctor foil yet another invasion of Earth.'),(1097,'User','The Doctor recruits you to help him defeat the Rani\'s latest evil scheme, which involves a dangerous device known as the Time Destabilizer.'),(1098,'User','You are Wiseguy, Strategy Specialist on a mission to keep a new weapon out of enemy hands.'),(1103,'User','You\'re the Outlaw, a G. I. Joe member who doesn\'t think a few rules should keep him from completing a mission. You\'re part of a team that\'s been dispatched to a remote island to secure an indestructible element before COBRA does.'),(1104,'User','Your codename is Presto. Your skills at misdirection and deception are key to distracting COBRA while the President meets with foreign dignitaries.'),(1107,'User','You\'re Delta, a Joe who can \"handle any aircraft that flies.\" While you\'re on guard duty, a top-secret plane is stolen from your base by COBRA.'),(1108,'User','Your codename is Wheels, after your magic touch with vehicles. Only you have the skills to figure out what\'s going on when COBRA suddenly begins attacking G. I. Joe on all fronts with new weapons.'),(1110,'User','You\'re Compass, G. I. Joe\'s best tracker. You\'re the only one with a hope of finding COBRA\'s secret base before they melt the polar ice caps.'),(1112,'User','The evil organization COBRA is developing a time machine in order to control the world, so you lead a team of G.I. Joe members to try to stop them.'),(1113,'User','You are Headset, an expert on the brain and hypnosis. These talents make you the man of the hour when COBRA launches a plot to enslave the minds of American citizens.'),(1117,'User','You\'re Bombshell, a Joe whose talent is to have a temper as explosive as your nickname. For some reason high command is sending you on a mission to stop COBRA from harnessing the mysterious powers of the pyramids.'),(1118,'User','A jewel necklace has been stolen, and people believe you\'re the culprit. You must find out who the real culprit is and bring him or her to justice.'),(1124,'User','You enlist the help of The Three Investigators to discover who is behind the robbery of a work of art in a deceased man\'s house.'),(1125,'User','The Three Investigators must solve a mystery related to an ancient dinosaur fossil belonging to a lost Native American tribe. '),(1126,'User','An evil ghost warrior has been unleashed on Third Earth, and you must help the Thundercats defeat it.'),(1129,'User','Simon and Thea Rhodes, the two children of an archaeologist, are visiting Turkey for the summer because their father has to authenticate some artifacts found on a sunken ship. Soon, they discover strange things happening at the archaeological site... and decide to investigate.'),(1135,'User','A boy\'s favorite baseball card has been ruined. Young readers and their parents can help him decide how to cope with his anger.'),(1141,'User','You come across an old woman who gives you a map which appears to lead to the magical gemstone segment that you need in order to become a really effective do-gooder. However, since finding the gemstone seems to be the Golden Girl equivalent of escaping from Gilligan\'s Island, you have much cause for suspicion....'),(1142,'User','Two of your allies have prophetic dreams, one involving captured children, the other involving the sought-after missing gemstone half....'),(1143,'User','A local stonecarver has found a mysterious crystal, and you set off to investigate....'),(1144,'User','The fiendish Insecticons gain control of the (rather dim) minds of the Dinobots, hoping to turn their powers to evil.'),(1145,'User','Bumblebee, the cute little Volkswagen Autobot, is out on a scouting mission when (rather unsurprisingly) he runs across the evil Decepticons.'),(1146,'User','The Autobots and Decepticons battle for control of the Sun-Pak, a solar-powered device which could greatly reduce the Transformers\' fuel demand.'),(1147,'User','While on a pleasure cruise, Beachcomber stumbles upon the secret Decepticon fortress. Funny how easily these ultra-well-hidden bases seem to turn up!'),(1148,'User','While the Autobots are in the desert looking for fuel, they hear a distant explosion. Meanwhile, Cosmos detects a Decepticon base from his post in outer space....'),(1149,'User','The Decepticons have poisoned the Autobots\' fuel, and now many are unable to transform! Obviously, something must be done about this....'),(1150,'User','The Autobots have a difficult decision when two evil Decepticon schemes arrive at once: an attempt to control all of Earth\'s communications <i>and</i> a quest to steal an ancient Autobot secret!'),(1151,'User','The Decepticons plan to zombify the audience of a huge rock concert using their latest evil invention, and it\'s up to the Autobots (and Sparkplug Witwicky) to stop them!'),(1152,'User','Two Autobots witness the landing of a spaceship that appears to have the ability to become invisible, and this eventually leads to a battle with the Decepticons for control of the power of invisibility.'),(1169,'User','Strange and alien creatures are haunting a peaceful village in Wales.  As a paranormal investigator, you are called upon to find the source of evil and expel the creatures to the Outer Darkness they came from before the world is destroyed.'),(1170,'User','In the previous adventure, you uncovered a magical artifact which you discover can be used for summoning the Egyptian goddess Het to this world.  A powerful servant of darkness steals the item from you, with the intention of taking it to Egypt and using it to summon the deity.  In order to prevent the world from being overrun by the forces of darkness, you must chase the thief on a journey across Europe, North Africa, and the Egyptian underworld.'),(1175,'User','Mario and his friends must save Subcon, the land of dreams, from the evil Wart.'),(1176,'User','Link must rescue Din, the Oracle of Seasons, from Onox, General of Darkness, in order to restore normal seasons to the land of Holodrum.'),(1177,'User','Link must travel through time and rescue Nayru, the Oracle of Ages, who is currently possessed by the evil Veran, Sorceress of Shadows.'),(1178,'User','Wario recounts his treasure-hunting adventures in the Golden Pyramid.'),(1182,'User','You are a contestant on a new reality TV show. You must unravel the mystery of an island with a sinister reputation -- and live to tell about it!'),(1190,'User','You\'re Tex Mex, the only Ghostbuster in the office when a call comes in about a haunted taxi.'),(1199,'User','The carnival has returned to town. Last year it was pitiful, but this year it\'s larger, more spectacular, and (of course) totally evil.'),(1200,'User','Your uncooperative younger brother stumbles into a time travel experiment at a museum and you must bring him back before his time runs out and he ceases to exist.'),(1201,'User','After moving to a new town you have difficulty making friends until you are invited by a boy you can\'t quite remember to a club meeting in a haunted house.'),(1202,'User','You and your best friend try to find your mother in the research lab where she works.'),(1203,'User','A summer vacation at WoodsWorld turns out to be rather unpleasant thanks to a multitude of werewolves.'),(1204,'User','Eating food in the off-limits basement of your aunt\'s house proves to be a bad idea - it causes your size to change dramatically.'),(1205,'User','Your annoying younger sister tags along when you go to the mall to meet a friend and ultimately ends up causing trouble in a magic shop.'),(1206,'User','The graveyard behind your grandmother\'s house is presently moving around by itself, a fact which unnerves you greatly....'),(1207,'User','A suit of armor brought to the U.S. from England has a curse on it connected to your family.'),(1208,'User','While examining an Egyptian mummy in an American-built pyramid-shaped skyscraper you stumble across an ancient diary which appears to have been written by the corpse... in English!'),(1209,'User','You go off the trail on a South American jungle tour with your friend Zoe and have an adventure.'),(1210,'User','On the way to a wax museum, you and two of your friends get in trouble and are forced to stay in the lobby when you reach your destination. Your friend Jake decides to wander off anyway, and it\'s all downhill from there....'),(1211,'User','You find a genie in a cola can and she offers you three wishes....'),(1212,'User','You get hired to clean out an inventor\'s garage, and what do you do? You go through the door you were specifically instructed to avoid at all costs!'),(1213,'User','The \"Vampire in a Can\" costume you just bought turns out to be a bit troublesome when you discover (the hard way) that the fake blood it contains turns whatever consumes it into a vampire!'),(1214,'User','You have to meet your grandmother at the train station. This being a gamebook, that doesn\'t prove to be a simple or safe task.'),(1215,'User','A shortcut home from school leads you to a comic shop. Unfortunately, wandering into the store leads to you getting trapped in an unusual place....'),(1216,'User','You\'re annoyed when you discover that you\'re going to have a babysitter and horrified when you discover that your babysitter is an evil imposter....'),(1217,'User','Your trip to a summer sports camp turns out to be considerably less pleasant than you expected....'),(1218,'User','You\'ve won a contest and now you have a choice: do you want to take a tour of a toy factory, or would you rather get your very own Annihilator 3000 toy robot?'),(1219,'User','Your summer vacation at Tiki Island turns out to be rather unpleasant thanks to a rumored curse....'),(1220,'User','Just when you thought you were safely away from the Carnival of Horrors, you find yourself trapped in it once more!'),(1221,'User','You pay a visit to Madame Zapp\'s Virtual Reality Arcade, where you get to participate in one of two different VR games: \"Abominable Snow Woman\" or \"Adrift off Vega.\"'),(1222,'User','You\'ve just moved into a new house, which happens to be directly adjacent to a swamp rumored to contain treasure... and ghosts.'),(1223,'User','Your friend Reggie makes a bet that you and another friend named Julie can\'t survive the hour from midnight to one A.M. in his father\'s store, which he claims is cursed. You foolishly accept.'),(1224,'User','While camping in the desert you find a shop and can buy one of two valuable items: a pair of magic snake eyes that will allow you to transform into different animals or a map to an old (and deadly) gold mine.'),(1225,'User','You and your friends get trapped in a hotel inhabited by ghosts and must find the only other human in the place in order to get out alive.'),(1226,'User','Your family goes on vacation to Cat Cay, an isolated island with a decidedly unconventional feline population.'),(1227,'User','You have the choice of seeing three different films: a <i>King Kong</i> rip-off, an espionage thriller or (of course) a horror flick. Whichever you choose, it proves rather more realistic than you had anticipated....'),(1228,'User','Your class trip to the E. Ville Creeper Botanical Gardens turns out to be a bit more interesting than expected....'),(1229,'User','A bit of plagiarism has won you a spot at the Twisted Tree Lodge horror convention; alas, all is not as it seems....'),(1230,'User','You\'re trying to sleep while visiting an inn with your parents; this is a little difficult since your bed\'s headboard is covered in creepy gargoyles and you have recurring nightmares about a strange being who calls himself the Sleep Master.'),(1231,'User','You\'ve installed some new web crawling software, and now your computer has a virus... a rather unusual one, at that.'),(1232,'User','You visit your science fair partner\'s uncle, an inventor, and get mixed up in adventures involving an elevator that leads to other dimensions.'),(1242,'User','You lag behind the rest of your class during a field trip to the museum and end up getting trapped by an insane Super Computer that wants you dead!'),(1243,'User','Eddie and Sue, the main characters of the twenty-seventh non-interactive <b>Goosebumps</b> book, escort you back 800 years in time to save England from a tyrannical threat.'),(1244,'User','You and your friend Richie have won the opportunity to participate in a real circus as a result of your excellent performance at circus camp. Of course, this being a horror story, it\'s not a very pleasant place to be....'),(1245,'User','You and your friend Trevor have dared each other to spend a night in Payne House, the setting of a horror movie you\'ve seen many times. Predictably enough, the movie is all too real....'),(1246,'User','While hiking through the desert, you find a cave. All too quickly, you manage to break an ancient skull and release a dangerous spirit, and it\'s now your job to undo the damage you have done!'),(1247,'User','You return from a trip to find out that your friend Jack has just fended off an alien invasion -- and a second one is just beginning!'),(1248,'User','It\'s Halloween, and your classmate Nathan has just tipped you off to a great place to acquire loads of candy!'),(1249,'User','In four mostly unrelated but somewhat parallel stories, your trip to Poison Lake turns out to be a decidedly horrific event.'),(1250,'User','You must face one of twelve possible opponents in six challenges, then face the dangers of the Eliminator on your own.'),(1251,'User','As in the previous book, you must face the seven standard challenges.'),(1254,'User','Queen Guinevere has been captured by the evil wizard Ansalom, and a young boy named Pip is chosen by Merlin to recover her.'),(1263,'User','You are a charioteer racing for the entertainment of the Emperor. If you win, you\'ll be rewarded; if you lose, it\'s off to the quartz mines!'),(1273,'User','You are a burglar living in a medieval fantasy city. Tonight you are robbing an especially wealthy - and dangerous - house.'),(1274,'User','You are a mercenary in an Aquilonian fort in the Pictish Wilderness, helping to defend it against forces commanded by a powerful wizard. You must uncover and - if possible - foil a plot to weaken the fort\'s defenses against an enemy assault.'),(1284,'User','You are on a search for treasure on the incredibly dangerous planet of Hark.'),(1285,'User','You must rescue the princess of Hark from one of two invading alien armies.'),(1286,'Cover','You are a volunteer missionary to Africa. It\'s up to you to decide how the plot turns out. Who knows what peril lurks ahead?'),(1287,'User','Del Curb, an experienced interplanetary investigator, is asked by the commander of the Federation Police to track down Rimeq the Renegade, a dangerous alien criminal threatening to destroy the Earth.'),(1288,'User','You are Chandelle, daughter of a famous jeweler. When monsters carry off your father, it\'s up to you and a handsome young knight to rescue him.'),(1289,'User','Your father, a powerful archdruid, disappeared years ago fighting evil. One day you meet a handsome bard who tells you your father is not only most likely alive, but has created a means to restore peace to your forest.'),(1290,'User','You are secretly a magic user in a kingdom where magic is forbidden until a little bird convinces you to seek greener pastures.'),(1291,'User','Your father wants you to give up your tomboyish dreams of destroying the evil wizard who ruined your family, but after you find a strange map, you have other plans....'),(1292,'User','Summer doesn\'t know what to do; her mother just wants her to get married and settle down, even though Summer owns the only weapon that can slay the dragon terrorizing their home.'),(1293,'User','Your stepfather doesn\'t understand what a free spirit you are, and when he tries to sell your beloved horse for dowry money, you run away from home to make your own destiny.'),(1301,'User','In the novella, an old wizard is haunted by what appears to be the ghost of his former master and it\'s up to one of his apprentices to save the day; in the <b>HeroQuest</b> scenario, a wizard has to find a magical item for the mysterious Cabiri; in the gamebook, a trainee wizard must cross the abyss at the edge of the world to save his master from captivity in the strange land at the other side.'),(1303,'User','You must pass the Ordeal of Courage to prove that you are a warrior. The Ordeal involves going off on an adventure and bringing back various trophies to prove that you were successful in combat.'),(1304,'User','You are the only survivor of a Ratikkan trading expedition to the southern city of Suthorp. Once you arrive in the city, you are offered a mission to venture into an ancient tomb and destroy an evil hydra.'),(1305,'User','At the beginning of the book, your character’s female companion, Ketza Kota, is kidnapped by slave traders. You must learn her whereabouts and eventually undertake a sea voyage to the land of Hitaxia in order to rescue her.'),(1306,'User','You journey to a jungle region south of Hitaxia in search of a lost city where immense power and wealth await you. Meanwhile, two powerful enemies are plotting to destroy you.'),(1314,'User','You can choose to play Jonathan Harker as he seeks to destroy Count Dracula, or Dracula himself as he faces off against his archenemy Van Helsing.'),(1317,'User','You enter an ancient tomb in search of a priceless diadem.'),(1327,'User','You must defeat a couple of aliens who are kidnapping other beings and making them fight in their armies.'),(1335,'LC','The reader tries to help Danny make decisions about using tobacco and shares with him the consequences of each decision.'),(1336,'LC','The reader tries to help Serena make decisions about drinking alcohol and shares with her the consequences of each decision.'),(1337,'LC','The reader tries to help Christy make decisions about using marijuana and shares with her the consequences of each decision.'),(1341,'User','In the novella, Treguard the Saxon battles to reclaim his ancestral home and to defend England from an ancient evil. In the gamebook, the reader goes on three missions in the Knightmare dungeon.'),(1342,'User','In the novella, Treguard meets an old foe and travels to a mysterious and dangerous wood; in the gamebook, the reader encounters characters from the novella and goes on a quest related to Treguard\'s earlier difficulties.'),(1343,'User','In the novella, Treguard searches for the lost heir of Richard the Lionheart; in the gamebook, the reader visits Knightmare Castle and goes on a fairly standard adventure through it.'),(1344,'User','Both the novella and gamebook deal with quests for the Holy Grail, though the novella follows Treguard and the gamebook allows the reader to do the adventuring.'),(1345,'User','In the novella, three children from the present day somehow find their way to Knightmare Castle; in the gamebook, the reader must travel to a distant island and retrieve the egg of a dragon.'),(1346,'User','In the novella, a boy from the twentieth century finds himself involved in a mission for Treguard involving the protection of a dragon egg; in the gamebook, the reader searches for a kidnapped future king.'),(1350,'User','The reader controls the actions of Red Lewis, a lawman in search of a murderer in the town of Abilene, Kansas.'),(1351,'User','The reader follows (and controls) the adventures of Johnny MacDonald, an innocent man accused of murdering his brothers.'),(1352,'User','An unusual lycanthrope causes problems for the kobolds....'),(1353,'User','Tabriz the Warlock has stolen a juicy baby from you, and you want it back! Unfortunately, that requires a visit to the Incredibly High Tower of Painful Mystical Death....'),(1354,'User','Thanks to the baby-snatching trend you initiated in Tabriz\'s Extremely High Tower, King Torg has dined upon a possessed infant, getting a demon stuck in his teeth in the process. Now you must travel to the dreaded Graveyard of the Necro-Groundhog and retrieve the fabled Toothpick of Exorcism.'),(1375,'User','You are a paladin-in-training, suddenly thrust into the role of savior of the world after your home is destroyed by evil forces.'),(1379,'User','You are Jason Kare, a young athlete trying out for the U. S. Lazer Tag Team in order to compete in the 3010 World Games. Your life becomes a bit more interesting after you overhear a suspicious conversation between two outworlders, however....'),(1380,'User','You are Zip Logan, Lazer Tag MVP; when you investigate a restaurant bombing on the famous planet of Ardria, you end up stumbling upon the world\'s dark secret....'),(1381,'User','You are team captain Blaze Dekker, and you have an unfortunate situation to deal with: your team has just been accused of kidnapping a whole rival team!'),(1383,'User','Transport barges have been disappearing lately, and since your father was lost with one, you set off to find out what\'s going on.'),(1384,'User','While exploring western Delta, you come across a wounded man who tells you the tale of an expedition lost in the desert, apparently imprisoned by a powerful cult.  Your quest in search of them takes you into an ancient Egyptian-like pyramid.'),(1385,'User','A new Mithral mine has been found in the mountain range of eastern Delta.  However, before the metal can be exploited, three problems have to be dealt with: dwarven ghosts are haunting the mine; elemental beings block outside access to it, and mysterious forest beings are attacking those who try to build a bridge that would connect the mine to civilization.  You are called to look into these matters, on a quest that will take more brain than brawn to complete.'),(1386,'User','The Margrave of Shekar has kidnapped Princess Wanda, daughter of the King of Delta.  Your mission is to enter the Margrave\'s castle and rescue the princess so she can marry her legitimate fiancé.'),(1399,'User','You are Silent Wolf, a young man studying with the Kai monks. When the Dark Lords attack and wipe out the Kai monastery, you rename yourself Lone Wolf and set off to warn the king of the approaching evil.'),(1400,'User','You must travel overseas to Durenor to recover the Sommerswerd, a magical weapon capable of driving back the Darklord invasion.'),(1402,'User','Vonotar, the traitorous magician who betrayed the Kai to the Darklords, has retreated to the icy realm of Kalte and taken control of the Ice Barbarians residing there; you must capture him and bring him to justice.'),(1403,'User','A convoy of gold and gems has disappeared, as has the troop of cavalry sent to investigate the disappearance; you must find out what has happened to everyone.'),(1404,'User','You are sent on a peace mission to the desert empire of Vassagonia. Unfortunately, things don\'t remain peaceful for long....'),(1405,'User','After three years of studying the Book of the Magnakai, you determine that you must discover an ancient artifact known as the Lorestone of Varetta.'),(1409,'User','This pack contains three metal Kai Lord miniatures: one with a sword, one with a hammer and one with a bow.'),(1420,'User','This boxed set contains miniatures representing the bridge battle from the first <a href=\"/Series/228\">Lone Wolf</a> gamebook: Sir Pelethor, a Gorgaz and six different Giak poses.'),(1422,'User','The search for the next Lorestone leads you to the dreaded castle of Kazan-Oud, inhabited by an evil sorcerer and isolated from the rest of the world by a magical shield.'),(1423,'User','Your quest for the Lorestones leads you to the heart of the Danarg, an evil swamp filled with horrible monsters.'),(1424,'User','The next Lorestone that you seek can be found in an ancient city located beneath the town of Tahou; unfortunately, the spreading Darklord armies threaten to complicate your visit to this region....'),(1425,'User','The Darklords have control of the final three Lorestones, but you have learned that they are currently held in the dungeons beneath the Drakkar fortress of Torgar.'),(1426,'User','This book contains the basic role-playing rules plus two adventures: <i>The Wishing Well</i> and <i>Shaggradd\'s Hives of Peril</i>.'),(1440,'User','Due to a Darklord trap, you (and the remaining Lorestones) are trapped on the Daziarn Plane.'),(1441,'User','When you return from the Daziarn, you discover that years have passed and the Darklords are on the verge of victory. Now is the time to take your long-awaited revenge!'),(1478,'User','Twenty-five years after the defeat of the Great Enchanter Drachenfels, a play is to be staged in honor of his defeat in the fortress where the final battle took place....'),(1479,'User','In three linked novellas, Genevieve encounters further theatrical danger, becomes part of a bizarre family and acts as a political assassin.'),(1480,'User','Someone or something is murdering women in Altdorf; some hope to solve the crimes while others hope to benefit from the distraction.'),(1544,'Cover','Rummaging through the ruins of the Ancients has been exhausting and unprofitable. You\'ve found nothing useful this time. Suddenly, you hear the sound of gravel shifting on the stones behind you. You turn and face an armed creature you\'ve never seen before.'),(1544,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 12, Attacks - 1'),(1547,'Cover','Rummaging through the ruins of the Ancients has been exhausting and unprofitable. You\'ve found nothing useful this time. Suddenly, you hear the sound of gravel shifting on the stones behind you. You turn and face an armed creature you\'ve never seen before.'),(1547,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 7, Attacks - 1'),(1549,'Cover','Standing in the torchlight, you study the flickering shadows searching the shifting darkness for the enemy of legends.  With your long ax you know you must hit hard -- and first -- before it can get too close.  Suddenly, the darkness comes alive!  You swing....'),(1549,'User','Statistics: Height - 3, Body Points - 14, Attacks - 1'),(1551,'Cover','Slowly you lift the heavy mace to your shoulder. Lurking around the cave mouth is someone - or something - you\'ve never faced before. What? Lunch, maybe, if it\'s not too big or strong. It\'s almost here; you leap to surprise it....'),(1551,'User','Height - 4, Body Points - 13, Attacks - 1'),(1555,'Cover','For hours you have led your foe along the high paths above the sea -- always one step ahead -- always away from your people. They are safe, now. Finally, on the brink, you turn to face the most dangerous enemy your clan has ever known.'),(1555,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 10, Attacks - 1'),(1557,'Cover','Big and mean and ugly, they said. Well, you showed them who\'s big and mean, anyway. Now you can hear another of the nasty little creatures out in your woods, trying to hide in the dark. This is too much! You\'re starting to get mad, and when you get mad....'),(1557,'User','Statistics: Height - 5, Body Points - 35, Attacks - 2/1R'),(1559,'Cover','As the village burns you examine your share of the loot: food and a couple of trinkets. Thin pickings. It\'s time to move on. Suddenly a figure rises from the edge of the firelight, no frightened villager, but something much more. You smile. Now, at last, a real fight.'),(1559,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 12, Attacks - 1'),(1561,'Cover','The years of searching, studying, digging through every scrap of parchment which survived the Ruin were worth it. At last -- you can do magic! Not the awesome magics of the Ancients, of course -- not yet. But still.... Suddenly, you hear footsteps in the passage outside your chambers. You sense it is no friend.'),(1561,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 12, Attacks - 1<br>Usable Cards: 1 sword, red spells (10 points)'),(1563,'Cover','The hunger returns. And so does the hatred of all who possess the precious life energy. Now you will go among them and cause fear and panic -- and to feed! Suddenly, you sense the presence of a living being -- but it does not flee or cower! It intends to fight for its life!'),(1563,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 8, Attacks - 2'),(1565,'Cover','First you thought it was ice melting, or perhaps a trinket falling. But there it is again. Wait, voices? INTRUDERS!! Here in your misty sanctuary. Robbers, thieves come to steal your treasure. Bold little dinners seeking glory. Suddenly you rise out of the cold mist to greet your unwelcome guests.'),(1565,'User','Statistics: Height - 6, Body Points - 60, Attacks - 2'),(1567,'Cover','Snug in your dwelling place by the running brook you wait for the call of adventure.  An invitation has come!  Your trusty daggers are sharpened, your mission is clear.  But what of the dangers that await, and the treasures to be discovered!'),(1567,'User','Statistics: Height - 3, Body Points - 11, Attacks - 1'),(1569,'Cover','The sounds are getting louder, now. Someone, or something, from outside has entered the swamp. It tries to be quiet but it does not know the ways of your land. The sounds of broken branches and occasional splashes betray its progress. You wait, motionless, as it approaches. Suddenly, the water ripples -- it\'s here!'),(1569,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 16, Attacks - 1'),(1571,'Cover','Everything fits. Now you feel like a real knight - except for the tense feeling in your stomach as you approach the lists. The armor looked good when you bought it but.... your opponent is larger than you thought and doesn\'t look nervous at all! Suddenly the trumpets sound! Doubt must vanish. You step forward. Glory to the victor!'),(1571,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 12, Attacks - 1'),(1573,'Cover','Carefully, now. You peer around the edge of the rock. There it is! But -- so many guards! Still, getting in won\'t be nearly as difficult as getting out again. As you prepare to cross an unsheltered gap in the rocks, you catch a small movement out of the corner of your eye. Spinning around, you realize -- secrecy is of no use now!'),(1573,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 12, Attacks - 1'),(1575,'Cover','There is a break in the trees. Up ahead is the ford in the river and, once across, the way home. This circuit of the forest is almost over. Suddenly, as you step into the clearing, the undergrowth parts on the other side. Whoever -- or whatever -- that is over there doesn\'t look inclined to let you pass.'),(1575,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 10, Attacks - 1 / 2'),(1577,'Cover','Day disappears as you emerge from your craggy home. Far down in narrow valleys it is already night. Suddenly, you spot movement below! Someone -- or something -- has dared to enter your realm and has not fled with the sun! Silently, you launch yourself from the cliff edge and begin a steep attack glide.'),(1577,'User','Statistics: Height - 4 (6 when flying), Body Points - 16, Attacks - 1'),(1578,'User','This is a collection of twelve red spells (16 - Extra Strength, 17 - Grow, 18 - Slow, 19 - Blur, 20 - Hand of Belo, 21 - Magic Lasso, 22- Retrieve Weapon, 23 - Sunburst, 24 - Weak Knees, 25 - Crushing Walls, 26 - Lightning Bolt and 27 - Insanity).'),(1583,'Cover','Humans battle undead guardians in the deserted castles and towers of the Ancients for treasure -- and magic!'),(1585,'Cover','The sounds of the hunt have followed you for days. You\'ve led them ever deeper into the forest. They are lost now, hungry and scared. Bu they have not given up and they are dangerous. As you enter the mystic glade you decide: Here is where you will make your stand! Suddenly the bushes across the clearing part... \r\n<p>Can your grace and magical skill overcome this deadly foe?'),(1587,'Cover','Honor demanded that you draw your sword. It can not now be sheathed until victory. Your opponent knows this as he circles. Tonight you will write a poem about theis battle. If you win. But first...'),(1587,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 12, Attacks - 1'),(1589,'Cover','Moving swiftly and silently from shadow to shadow, you have slipped past the guards unseen. Now there remains just one barrier to the completion of your mission. Suddenly, a guard turns the corner ahead! Secrecy is gone! You prepare to make your escape. But first...'),(1589,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 12, Attacks - 1'),(1593,'Cover','Sunlight filtering through the trees warms your fur as you rest on the lawn of the abandoned temple. But now, you feel you are being watched. There! You spot movement at the edge of the clearing. Nothing has dared trespass here in an age. Stretching your great wings, you rise to face this bold intruder.'),(1593,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 20, Attacks - 1'),(1594,'Cover','Bith, princess and daughter of the evil sorceress Morea, has rebelled from her mother\'s control. She has left the devastated lands beyond the Mistwall, an ominous cloud which marks the boundary between good and evil. With limited but growing magical powers, she seeks her own destiny among the peoples of the unconquered lands.'),(1594,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 10, Attacks - 1<br>\r\nUsable Cards: red or yellow magic (12 points)'),(1601,'Cover','Caltus Talienson, former squire to Sir Edric, is a soldier of fortune with no fortune in sight. His family home lies in ruins beyond the dreaded Mistwall, destroyed by the forces of the Dark Lord. Cal now seeks the mystical Runeswords, extraordinarily powerful weapons forged by the dwarves at the behest of a god. Of the four heroes of Cairngorn, only he has the skill, the strength, and the blind determination to wield the dangerous amd powerful Runeswords.'),(1601,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 12, Attacks - 1 / 3 (with Runesword)<br>\r\nUsable Cards: tactics (5 points)'),(1602,'Cover','Endril, outcast and mysterious elf from a distant land, has been banished from the sylvan village and beech forests of his homeland. His age is measured in centuries, his perception of time and nature inconsistent with the fleeting and fragile world of humanity. With deadly accurate bow and ancient elven magic, he wanders the lands before the Mistwall searching for the key to the mysteries which will restore his honor, free his homeland, and allow him to rejoin the community of elves.'),(1602,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 8, Attacks - 1<br>\r\nUsable Cards: red or yellow magic (10 points)'),(1603,'Cover','Hathor, a red-haired, axe-wielding troll, is an enigma in the world of Runesword, for he has sworn off the carnivorous habits of his kind and adopted the ways of civilized society. He has turned the strengths of his trollish past against the minions of evil which emanate from the dreaded Mistwall. His loyalty to the outcast heroes of Cairngorn, and especially to the young mage Bith, is unshakable.'),(1603,'User','Statistics: Height - 5, Body Points - 37, Attacks - 2<br>\r\nUsable Cards: tactics (4 points)'),(1604,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 12, Attacks - 1<br>\r\nUsable Cards: 1 sword, 4 scrolls, tactics (4 points), red spells (12 points)'),(1605,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 12, Attacks - 1<br>\r\nUsable Cards: 1 foil (sword), 1 pistol, tactics (2 points), luck (7 points)'),(1606,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 10, Attacks - 1<br>\r\nUsable Cards: 1 baton (mace), 1 lead cap, tactics (2 points), luck (9 points)'),(1608,'User','Statistics: Height - 5 (7), Body Points - 45, Attacks - 1<br>\r\nUsable Cards: luck (5 points)'),(1610,'User','Statistics: Height - 22, Body Points - 34, Attacks - 1'),(1611,'User','Statistics: Height - 22, Body Points - 62, Attacks - 1'),(1612,'User','Statistics: Height - 46, Body Points - 75, Attacks - 1'),(1613,'User','Statistics: Height - 28, Body Points - 65, Attacks - 1'),(1614,'User','Statistics: Height - 16, Body Points - 50, Attacks - 1'),(1615,'User','Statistics: Height - 39, Body Points - 80, Attacks - 1'),(1617,'User','Statistics: Height - 3, Body Points - 6<br>Usable Cards: Dagger, purple spells (12 points), luck (15 points)'),(1618,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 9, Attacks - 1'),(1620,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 14, Attacks - 1<br>\r\nUsable Cards: katana & scimitar (swords), tactics (5 points), luck (2 points)'),(1621,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 15, Attacks - 1<br>\r\nUsable Cards: 1 scimitar (sword), 1 shield, luck (3 points)'),(1622,'User','Statistics: Height - 3, Body Points - 16, Attacks - 1<br>\r\nUsable Cards: 1 sword, 1 horn, yellow spells (5 points), purple spells (5 points)'),(1623,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 12<br>\r\nUsable Cards: luck (3 points)<br>\r\nOnly Possession: a large bone (which argues that he/it may be unable to use other items such as armor, swords, etc.)'),(1624,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 18, Attacks - 1<br>\r\nUsable Cards: 1 morning star, 1 shield, tactics (3 points), luck (3 points)'),(1640,'Cover','Umslopagaas came from the jungle lands near the Dragon\'s Claws. With ebony skin and ivory teeth, with ironwood staff which could dash the brains from man or monster, he was a fighting wizard welcome in any group of adventurers facing evil magic and long odds. Deep in Uncle Ugly\'s Underground, Umslop claimed a Zodiac Gem as part of his plunder, and it claimed him -- giving him a lethal scorpian\'s [sic] sting growing from the base of his spine. Now, twice as deadly as before, he runs his own dungeon in Khosht -- the famed Deathtrap Equalizer Dungeon. Meet him in combat if you dare, but don\'t be surprised if he vanishes in a cloud of sorcery if you\'re skilled enough to wound him. A smart wizard always gives himself a way out.'),(1640,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 17, Attacks - 1<br>\r\nUsable Cards: 1 staff, 5 general items, red spells (14 points)<br>\r\nCard Types Included: 3 Red Spells, 1 Random Card'),(1642,'Cover','Kharis is the guardian of the ruins of Tor menchi, where in life his treachery brought destruction.  Now in everlasting penitence, he rots away guarding the very treasure he betrayed.  Beward, for this fiend of life is a noble adversary.  Some say to avoid this place called Tor menchi; go elsewhere, into the light of day.  But if the prize is more precious than life, then a king\'s ransom waits, glittering amidst these fallen towers.  Dare you to think?  Dare you to plot?'),(1642,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 12<br>\r\nUsable Cards: luck (3 points)'),(1643,'Cover','Chiron clambered up the craggy cliff. Few other beings had the ability to patrol the crater\'s rim, and only the foolhardy dared. \"But wait! Is that not an intruder? Some silly being is making his way up the treacherous pass. He answers not my hail -- then answer this!\" said Chiron to himself as he hurled a persuasive spell, bathing the intruder in an engulfing glow of crimson magic. yet onward the intruder came. Readying his axe, Chiron prepared for the inevitable.'),(1643,'User','Statistics: Height - 5, Body Points - 20, Attacks - 2<br>\r\nUsable Cards: 1 axe, chainmail and helm, 1 shield, 3 general items, red spells (6 points)<br>\r\nCard Types Included: 3 Red Spells, 1 Random Card'),(1645,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 12, Attacks - 1<br>\r\nUsable Cards: 1 sword, 3 spears, leather armor or better, 5 general items, tactics (4 points)<br>\r\nCard Types Included: 2 Tactics, 2 Random Cards'),(1646,'Cover','Time has no meaning within the confines of the lamp. The price for your great power is this brass prison. As you stare down at the unknowing fool who rubbed the lamp, you realize you have another chance for freedom. You will grant their wish, but only if they can defeat you. Energy crackles as you tower over your new enemy...'),(1646,'User','Statistics: Height - 3 / 5, Body Points - 35, Attacks - 2<br>\r\nUsable Cards: 1 sword, 3 scrolls, 3 general items, purple spells (12 points)<br>\r\nCard Types Included: 3 Purple Spells, 1 Random Scroll'),(1647,'Cover','High on the slopes of the Fioree Mountains, the last refuge of the fire giants, you guarded your domain from intruders during the War of the Dwarves. Perhaps the war is over, you think. But no! Someone approaches through the great pass. You lift your great axe and start down the mountain, a challenge forming on your lips.'),(1647,'User','Statistics: Height - 5, Body Points - 20, Attacks - 2<br>\r\nUsable Cards: 1 axe, 1 leather armor, 3 general items, tactic cards (5 points)<br>\r\nCard Types Included: 2 Tactic Cards, 2 Random Cards'),(1648,'Cover','The theft of the crown jewels was almost too great an insult to bear. Fearing a conspiracy to discredit the throne, the King dispatched you, his best knight, to ride like the wind and recover the royal property. As your horse\'s hooves thunder on the road, you see a stranger to these lands. Maybe this is the thief! You spur your horse and charge.'),(1648,'User','Statistics: Height - 4 / 5, Body Points - 14, Attacks - 1 / 2<br>\r\nUsable Cards: 1 sword, 1 chain mail, 1 helm, 1 charger, 5 general items<br>\r\nCard Types Included: 1 Sword, 3 Random Items'),(1649,'Cover','Your quest has taken you far from your home, through a dozen forests and countless encounters. Your sword arm is tired, but you cannot rest until you find the medallion you seek. The foliage parts in the distance to reveal someone you have never seen before. Perhaps they have the medallion that could end your quest.'),(1649,'User','Statistics: Height - 4, Body Points - 14, Attacks - 1<br>\r\nUsable Cards: 1 sword and 1 dagger, 1 leather armor, 3 general items, yellow spells (8 points)<br>\r\nCard Types Included: 3 Yellow Spells, 1 Random Card'),(1650,'User','The reader decides the fate of Les, a lucky cat just out of boarding school.'),(1653,'User','You are an assassin, and an attempt to abduct you leads you into an adventure....'),(1663,'User','You are an amateur radio aficionado in the distant future. One day you overhear a message about a gold robbery, and you are drawn into a mission to find and capture the culprit.'),(1666,'User','This highly sought-after volume includes lots of information on the history, geography, culture and dangers of Magnamund along with a board game, information on building models, and a brief gamebook.'),(1667,'User','You are Banedon the magician, and you have a vitally important message to deliver to the Kai Monastery....'),(1669,'User','You are are a cat who has decided to leave home after questioning the loyalty of your master.'),(1671,'User','You are Thumbelina, a tiny girl, and you get kidnapped by a frog who wants to marry you to her son. Oh dear.'),(1672,'User','This espionage tale takes place in New Orleans during Mardi Gras.'),(1673,'User','In order to escape an evil scientist trying to steal your father\'s time machine you use the machine to travel back in time.'),(1680,'User','A politically important wedding is threatened by multiple dangers....'),(1681,'User','A group of paladins head for Undermountain on a rescue mission while \r\npowerful monsters from the Abyss embark on a journey in the same general direction....'),(1682,'User','A mysterious man hires a group of pirates for a secret mission....'),(1683,'User','The paladins travel from the gate in Undermountain to a kingdom of the Utter East, where they face a new set of dangers and dilemmas.'),(1684,'User','The pirates from book three must make a dangerous overland journey after losing another ship....'),(1701,'User','Your parents have bought a resort, but they\'re making you do chores. You don\'t like that, so you decide to take a day off; this leads to a diversity of strange adventures.'),(1704,'User','An avalanche cuts off the power of your house. You have a series of adventures due to the avalanche.'),(1707,'LC','Provides the reader with the starting lineup of the Steel City Blues and choices to make in managing the team, tied for first place with the Bay City Sharks, through the last game of the year.'),(1709,'User','This work is rather unusual; it consists of a grid of thirty-six paragraphs connected by arrows.  The reader can pick any path through the grid connected by arrows and get a complete story.  Decisions are more or less random since the arrows don\'t feature labels, but there is nonetheless an element of interactivity.'),(1711,'User','Your nose is missing.  Silliness ensues.'),(1713,'User','You are Spider-Man, and you must find and stop a mysterious villain who has taken control of all energy in the city of New York.'),(1714,'User','As Captain America, you must foil a plan by the supervillain Viper to spread deadly weaponry across the United States.'),(1715,'User','You are X-Men superhero Wolverine.  One day, while visiting a friend in Washington, you\'re ambushed by a group of villains. Will you find out why they want to capture you alive, or will you simply rescue your friend and escape your captors?'),(1716,'User','You are Doctor Strange, Sorcerer Supreme of the Earth Dimension.  In this adventure, your task is to defend Earth from two alien armies who have chosen it as the new battleground in a centuries-old struggle.'),(1717,'User','A villain called the Red Ghost comes to the Fantastic Four with a bizarre request for help; he\'s contracted a seemingly incurable disease, and just infected them with it.'),(1718,'User','You play a troupe of four X-Men (Wolverine, Rogue, Storm and Nightcrawler) investigating a United States government project\r\ngone wrong. Along the way you\'ll have to deal with corrupt\r\ngovernment officials, ninja assassins and another mysterious evil\r\nagency.'),(1719,'User','You are Spider-Man.  With the help of Doctor Strange, you must travel around the globe and retrieve three pieces of an extremely powerful magic item before the villain Mordo does.'),(1720,'User','You are Daredevil, and an investigation into illegal dumping quickly leads you into something much more threatening: a\r\nsinister plot to smear your name and force you out of circulation.'),(1723,'User','As a European secret agent, you must infiltrate an island in the Caribbean which is the hideout of a villain nicknamed Mr. Happiness. Your objective is to foil his development of highly destructive weapons and capture or kill him.'),(1734,'User','He-Man must find and destroy the evil Memory Stone used by Skeletor to steal Man-at-Arms\' memory.'),(1739,'User','Your aunt takes you and your dog to the 1904 St. Louis World\'s Fair. It doesn\'t take long for you to get lost and find yourself being pursued by dog-eating Igorot tribesmen.'),(1752,'User','The events in this book take place shortly before the War of the Ring begins.  You are Saruman the White\'s favorite apprentice, but\r\nyou believe Saruman might be guilty of treason against the White Council.  You have to explore the citadel of Orthanc surreptitiously in order to find proof of Saruman\'s treason, then flee the realm of Isengard and reach Lothlórien to warn Lady Galadriel of the wizard\'s treachery.'),(1753,'User','The events in this book begin on the eve of the Battle of Helm\'s Deep against Saruman\'s forces.  You are a young Rohirrim warrior\r\nand a member of the Hornburg garrison.  One night you spy one of your commanders turning military information over to the enemy.  Will you enter the secret tunnel that leads to the Westfold and attempt to prevent the information from reaching Sauron\'s army?  Or will you remain at the Citadel to help with the defense and possibly\r\nunmask the traitor?'),(1754,'User','This book takes place during the Fourth Age, in the first few years after the War of the Ring\'s end. A clan of Dwarfs has hired you to enter the long-abandoned Mines of Moria and retrieve a lost will. Along the way you\'ll have to face orcs, trolls and many other creatures, as well as members of a rival clan who want the document for themselves.'),(1755,'User','The events in this book take place shortly before the War of the Ring.  The magical Palantir stones of Annuminas and Amon Sul have been recovered by a tribe in the Forodwaith, and Gandalf and Aragorn have sent you on a quest to put them where no one will be able to use them.  Along the way you\'ll have to face rival clans of elves, the minions of Sauron and a creature which is an incarnation of primal evil.  And will you be able to overcome your own greed for the stones?'),(1762,'User','You are a Ranger of the North who decides to wander in search of adventure after arriving too late to participate in the Battle of the Pelennor Fields. You find that the daughter of a farmer\'s wife has been kidnapped by two Haradrim, and are offered a mission to rescue her.'),(1770,'User','Mr. Buckethead gets to choose between visiting the candy store or the toy store; somehow, this eventually leads him to prehistoric jungles and the dangerous surface of the moon.'),(1771,'User','Mr. Buckethead has the opportunity to Kung-Fu fight, drive a race car, amass an army of Smile Face Zombies, and battle the evil Doctor Neuron, among other things....'),(1780,'LC','As the fictional friend of David, King of Israel, the reader makes decisions involving David\'s life.'),(1781,'LC','As the fictional best friend of Esther, young Queen of Persia, the reader makes decisions affecting Esther\'s fight to save her people from destruction.'),(1807,'LC','The reader\'s choices determine the outcome of a young person\'s nightmare which requires that he or she either escape from danger or fight the Molers who conquered earth in the war of 2051.'),(1808,'LC','While on a camping trip, the reader gets lost in a cave and makes choices which determine the story\'s outcome.'),(1809,'LC','The reader\'s decisions control the outcome of a stay in a nightmarish castle in Scotland.'),(1810,'LC','The reader chooses the outcome of a teenage boy\'s nightmare in which he searches a Malaysian jungle for his missing brother and anthropologist father.'),(1811,'User','Everything\'s suddenly appearing in pairs, and it\'s getting rather crowded in the Mushroom Kingdom; clearly the Koopas are involved.'),(1812,'User','Luigi is late for a picnic in the Mushroom Kingdom, and his day pretty much goes downhill from there....'),(1813,'User','A day at the circus goes sour when the princess is kidnapped... again. Soon, a plot involving strangely re-combined monsters is revealed.'),(1814,'User','Luigi has been recruited by Bowser to rescue the missing Wendy O. Koopa!'),(1815,'User','It\'s the princess\' birthday, but one of her presents isn\'t what it seems....'),(1816,'User','A mad scientist has unleashed the Doors to Doom machine, which connects different dimensions and thereby creates the means for world conquest!'),(1817,'User','Mario and Luigi are on vacation on Dinosaur Island, but they can\'t have peace for long....'),(1818,'User','A trip to a dinosaur flying show turns out to be less relaxing than everyone had hoped....'),(1819,'User','Link and Zelda stumble into one of Ganon\'s traps....'),(1820,'User','During an encounter with moblins, Link and Zelda meet a mysterious stranger....'),(1821,'User','It\'s Yoshi\'s birthday. Unfortunately, somebody has put something bad in the cake....'),(1822,'User','A day fixing the royal soda machine is disrupted when people (and creatures) mysteriously start switching bodies.'),(1824,'User','You must build your strength for the battle to come with the evil Dragonlord.'),(1827,'User','You are a butcher looking for a fun way to spend your day off....'),(1828,'User','A good knight and a devious wizard enter the ancient Castle Arcania and battle to the death over the woman they both love, Princess Mara.'),(1829,'User','Champions of two star-faring races scour the galaxy for pieces of the Ancient Robot, a powerful and dangerous artifact of a lost civilization.'),(1830,'User','One player, as the Black Knight, flees towards his castle after reclaiming a stolen family treasure while the other, as the Red Dragon, attempts to reclaim a friend the Knight kidnapped on the way out.'),(1831,'User','A wizard and a druid race to stop the evil forces growing in the Forest of Lath, each also hoping to capture the other in order to gain ransom money for his own faction.'),(1832,'User','Fritz Leiber\'s famous thieves are after a fabled treasure, but their quest is hindered by the efforts of a series of greedy assassins.'),(1833,'User','Two heroes wander through the icy lands of World\'s End in search of a valuable magical weapon.'),(1836,'User','Superhero Daredevil and criminal mastermind Kingpin battle one another in New York.'),(1837,'User','A Knight of Solamnia and a Dragon Highlord race to find an ancient magical artifact.'),(1846,'User','The reader is given various silly choices which determine what story is told; it usually involves vegetables discussed in the tone of a fairy tale.'),(1847,'User','A play involving the complicated lives of a royal family is summarized, with spots where the audience could change the course of the play presented in standard gamebook fashion.'),(1850,'User','You enter the keep of a Sidhe Noble in order to retrieve a magical pelt belonging to an innocent Selkie.'),(1854,'User','You are a red security clearance troubleshooter living in Alpha Complex. One day, the Computer asks you to join two other troubleshooters on a mission. Of course, this being the Paranoia RPG, the mission turns out to be fraught with danger.'),(1858,'User','Leda, an elvish Rogue/Wizard who left home to study magic in the city, finds her past catching up with her and her future likely to get more interesting.'),(1867,'LC','Older sister Ann helps Brad and Pam pass a rainy day by teaching them why popcorn pops.'),(1869,'User','You and some relatives compete to meet the challenge left in a rich uncle\'s will: to find the Dandee Diamond.'),(1870,'User','Your father has been hired to run a fancy new roller coaster, which would be great if not for the fact that it\'s haunted.'),(1871,'User','There\'s a major little league game today, and if all goes well you\'ll be accepted into the Babe Ruth League!'),(1872,'User','It promises to be a boring summer until scientists report mysterious pink orbs looming over the Earth....'),(1873,'User','If you can win Horace B. Hokum\'s bike race, you\'ll get a shopping spree and your town will get a recreation center!'),(1874,'User','You\'ve been given the opportunity to work at your grandfather\'s hotel in the Rocky Mountains, an exciting place visited by the rich and famous.'),(1875,'User','The year is 2020, and you are on the Space Shuttle Astra, on your way to rescue your mother from the incessant babbling of her dull sister.'),(1876,'User','Someone is stealing all of the lawn flamingos in Flamingoville. With the help of a magic top, you set out to find the culprit.'),(1877,'User','While visiting your uncle\'s wilderness park, you get an unexpected ride on a runaway elephant!'),(1878,'User','You\'re on a field trip to the museum, and you can\'t wait to see the mummy!'),(1879,'User','Your uncle has devised a time travel mechanism, and its first test leads to predictable results.'),(1880,'User','You are a ballerina competing against both your best friend and your worst enemy for the role of Fairy Princess in a National Ballet Company production.'),(1881,'User','Your elevator stops at the 13th floor of a building, and things just kind of get weirder from there.'),(1882,'User','You\'ve won a robot thanks to your great performance at the science fair, and you just couldn\'t resist the urge to give it some custom programming....'),(1883,'User','You\'ve got a ransom note in your hand, a sack of money on your kitchen table, and a lot of decisions to make....'),(1884,'User','It\'s your first summer at sleepaway camp and there are all kinds of fun things to do!'),(1885,'User','Alien pods are causing weird mutations in a local creek....'),(1886,'User','You\'ve been invited to your rich friend Emilee\'s party, and you need to find a date to go with.'),(1887,'User','It\'s spring break, so you and some friends set off for the beach in search of shallow wish-fulfillment!'),(1888,'User','You\'re the manager of the Bombers, nicknamed the \"Clawing Cats,\" and you must make decisions during a baseball game which, if won, will give you the pennant.'),(1889,'User','You must guide the Warriors into victory as they challenge the Gorillas for a chance at the Super Bowl.'),(1890,'User','Having won the pennant (in book one), you must now bring the Bombers to victory in the World Series.'),(1891,'User','In this direct sequel to <a href=\"/Item/1889\">Pro Football Showdown</a>, the Warriors face the Sharks in the Super Bowl.'),(1892,'User','Having won the World Series, you now need to get a new season off to a good start.'),(1893,'User','It\'s time to start a new season after leading your team to victory in the Super Bowl.'),(1894,'LC','The reader may choose each new development as a team of ex-commandos attempts to rescue a beautiful girl from the palace of a Latin American general.'),(1895,'LC','The reader may choose from plots involving a kidnapped boy, a stolen horse, and a missing young woman, and direct the development of each one.'),(1908,'LC','Aboard the U.S.S. <i>Enterprise</i>, Captain Kirk and Mister Spock respond to a distress call from the planet Varda III. The reader is allowed to make decisions which determine how the plot will proceed.'),(1909,'LC','Tony Manero cherishes his dream of becoming a professional dancer on Broadway, working hard to get his big break in a world of tryouts and rejections. The reader may choose among multiple storylines.'),(1910,'LC','Trapped by a storm in a mysterious and frightening house, the reader is given several alternative choices to manipulate the plot and plan an escape.'),(1911,'LC','The reader, trapped after closing in the newest and largest department store in Atlanta, is given choices to make to remove himself from the night of terror.'),(1912,'LC','The reader faces a choice of unknown horrors in the Vanguard Air, Rocket, and Space Museum after it closes, late one night.'),(1913,'LC','Trapped in a historic hotel high on a cliff overlooking a river, the reader must make choices in order to remove himself from the horrors he finds there.'),(1914,'LC','The reader visits Noose City, a Texas ghost town famous for the ghosts of executed criminals, which reappear each year on the anniversaries of their deaths; the reader makes choices which determine the outcome of the plot.'),(1915,'LC','The reader visits a seaside amusement park where the rides turn out to be more terrifying than amusing; the reader makes choices which determine the outcome of the plot.'),(1916,'LC','Trapped by a thunderstorm in a museum of prehistoric creatures that seem to come alive, the reader must find a way out of increasingly frightening situations.'),(1917,'LC','The reader must find a way of excaping from Duncarney Castle where he/she is surrounded by evil ogres, black knights, witches, and many other unsavory characters.'),(1918,'User','Jessie sets up a Pokémon match designed to humiliate Ash, so he must set off in search of a rare new Pokémon with which to defeat her and protect his reputation.'),(1947,'User','You are Edrix, the rightful heir to the throne, forced to live the life of a thief while waiting for the moment to claim what is yours. Your shadowy existence is no longer a secret, so the time is right to make your first move....'),(1948,'User','The usurper of your throne has planned a politically convenient marriage for himself, and you plan to intervene by kidnapping the bride-to-be.'),(1974,'User','You crawl dungeons and kill monsters.'),(1975,'User','Once again, you crawl dungeons and slay monsters; this time, more Toxic Toads are involved than last time....'),(1988,'User','A wanderer tells you where to find a dragon statue of immense value, but also poisons you to make sure you live up to your promise to split the proceeds with him.'),(1989,'User','This introductory collection includes two books plus a rules sheet featuring four cut-out Tactical Move Cards: 5 - Tallen\'s Block, 6 - Robert\'s Smash, 7 - Niko\'s Attack and 8 - Veltan Pounce.'),(2011,'User','This translation replaces the invisible ink of the original English edition with a red plastic decoder sheet.'),(2017,'User','The fact that this book\'s Dutch title translates back into English as <a href=\"/Item/57\">The Trial of Champions</a> can cause some confusion, but this is in fact a translation of <a href=\"/Item/43\">Deathtrap Dungeon</a>.'),(2082,'User','An Elf scouting mission turns into a race for the survival of the whole Realm!'),(2083,'User','You have been sent to a Human Kingdom in order to ask them for help in your fight against growing Dark Forces.'),(2084,'User','You\'ve finally reached Stumland to request King Edoar\'s help against the coming of Dark forces to your Elf realm. But not even in his castle will you be safe from evil plots and treasons....'),(2093,'User','Your wizard employer sends you into the city looking for a special flower he needs in order to prepare a spell.'),(2094,'User','Your wizard master needs your help in order to get through a magic contest being held in the city.'),(2095,'User','Your wizard employer sends you on a quest to find and kill a werewolf who has been terrorizing a nearby village.'),(2103,'User','In a surreal, thumb-filled world, Skrump, Naeelah, Figbash and Hooglyboo battle one another with innocuous household items.  Several unrelated tangents intervene.'),(2105,'User','In the land of Vitan, you are the last descendent of the great hero Grey Wulf and thus the last person potentially capable of fulfilling an ancient prophecy and saving the world.'),(2114,'User','You are Lucas Marks, a halfling thief. Your partner has been kidnapped as the result of a ring you acquired recently, and you must rescue her!'),(2115,'User','You are Jamie Douglas, a student of history.  Near the end of a stressful semester, you mysteriously awaken in a sarcophagus in the local museum....'),(2133,'User','As in the episode of the same name, one local virus hires Enzo to deliver a gift to the other local virus. It\'s hardly a gesture of good will, of course....'),(2134,'User','The citizens of Mainframe wake up one morning to find the system overrun with \"weird fractal vegetation.\"'),(2139,'User','You must find and destroy an evil wizard within ten weeks, or he will conquer the land and turn everyone into undead.'),(2152,'User','This book includes several scenarios, one of which is designed for solitaire play.'),(2160,'User','Ben, a young magician, finds the kit of a famous magician known as Dr. Presto and discovers that it works all too well....'),(2161,'User','Amy, a shy, lonely girl, gets a necklace for her twelfth birthday which allows her to become invisible.'),(2162,'User','Evan Kim, a fan of <i>Harriet the Spy</i>, acquires a very special piece of surveillance equipment from Sebastian Cream\'s Junk Shop....'),(2163,'User','When a teenager selects a marble from Sebastian Cream\'s Junk Shop, she is unaware that it is the missing eye of one very angry gargoyle.'),(2164,'User','Baseball fanatic Matthew Carter is a great catcher but can\'t hit to save his life... until he finds an unusual baseball bat in Sebastian Cream\'s Junk Shop.'),(2165,'User','A pair of twins stop into the Scream Shop to pick up a gift for their great-aunt, who they will meet for the first time during a trip to Mexico during el Dia de los Muertos.'),(2166,'User','After a visit to Sebastian Cream\'s Junk Shop, horror comic collector Ivan Melchik learns that there is more truth than one might think to some of his favorite reading material.'),(2167,'LC','When Sean, a devoted bookworm, buys a strange-looking fantasy novel from Sebastian Cream\'s Junk Shop, he ignores the book\'s warning and reads it after midnight, when he is drawn into a world of terrifying trolls.'),(2177,'LC','The reader makes decisions for Serena and James as they struggle with the question of whether to have sex or to wait.'),(2182,'User','This book contains two mysteries to solve.  In the first one, a prestigious racing horse loses a race under suspicious circumstances, and as a private detective, you are called upon to\r\nfind the culprit, the motive and the drug used to slow down the\r\nhorse.\r\n<p>In the second half of the adventure, a dishonest businessman with a checkered past suddenly dies of a stroke in a prestigious London\r\nclub.   If he was murdered, who did it, how and why?  There are many\r\nsuspects, but finding the actual culprit will require uncovering a\r\ntragic past that no one seems to want to discuss anymore...'),(2183,'User','In this book you play David Rogers, a student at a British public school.  A valuable South American jewel has been stolen, and there are six suspects, but you’re one of them!  Things are further complicated by the appearance of the rightful owners of the jewel, a group of Amazonian aborigines who will stop at nothing to recover it.'),(2184,'User','A blackmailer is shot to death in his elegant mansion at midnight.  Can you find out who did it and why?  And why do Holmes and Watson seem uninterested in helping you?  Could it be that they have other motivations rather than ethics?'),(2185,'User','A dishonest businessman is found murdered.  The evidence seems to point towards Sherlock Holmes\' companion, Dr. Watson.  Can you prove Watson\'s innocence and bring the real culprit to justice?'),(2186,'User','You are a young officer in the British Army.  One night, the body of your best friend is found in a subway station, just after a bombing by an Irish separatist terrorist group called \'The Dynamiters.\'  Was your friend an innocent victim of a terrorist attack?  Or was he murdered?  You decide to undertake the investigation, without knowing that you are being pulled into the web of a conspiracy to overthrow the Parliament and turn the United Kingdom into a dictatorial state.'),(2187,'User','Every year, Colonel Alexander Dunlop holds in his estate a reenactment of an historical duel. During this year\'s event, a valuable relic from the Napoleonic Wars is going to be exhibited at the Colonel\'s house. Your job as a private investigator is to protect the relic from being stolen. But what if suddenly you found yourself having to solve a sinister mystery?'),(2188,'User','A Buckingham Palace guard is found stabbed in the palace gardens.  Since only one of the Royal Family could have done the deed, you are called upon to investigate the crime.  Can you solve it before the guard dies and a public scandal develops?  And can you dismantle a foreign spy\'s plans to uncover British state secrets while you are at it?'),(2189,'User','A wealthy man needs your help to find his nephew, who disappeared as a boy under tragic circumstances.  Since an inheritance is at stake, five different men have shown up, each claiming to be the rightful heir.  Are they all imposters, or is the real nephew among them?  Things are further complicated when you discover someone is trying to assassinate one of the candidates...'),(2193,'User','If you eat a brussels sprout, you can have some ice cream!'),(2194,'User','A boy is given birthday money and must decide whether or not to give it to a panhandler....'),(2195,'Cover','Chocolate or Vanilla? This simple choice is all it takes to get started with Meanwhile, the wildly inventive creation of comics mastermind Jason Shiga, of whom Scott McCloud said “Crazy + Genius = Shiga.” Jimmy, whose every move is under your control, finds himself in a mad scientist’s lab, where he’s given a choice between three amazing objects: a mind-reading device, a time-travel machine, or the Killitron 3000 (which is as ominous as it sounds). Down each of these paths there are puzzles, mysterious clues, and shocking revelations. It’s up to the reader to lead Jimmy to success or disaster.\n\nMeanwhile is a wholly original story of invention, discovery, and saving the world, told through a system of tabs that take you forward, backward, upside down, and right side up again. Each read creates a new adventure!'),(2195,'User','A bad decision while purchasing ice cream can lead to all manner of adventures with weird scientific inventions.'),(2197,'User','Your father and your uncle have developed a matter transmission technology, but the evil slave-trading Ganoxians show up to make life complicated....'),(2198,'User','You\'re a veteran of the Vietnam War working for the CIA as an espionage agent. Your latest assignment is to return to the site of the war which scarred you in search of a fallen spy satellite; while you\'re there, you also hope to rescue an old buddy...'),(2199,'User','You are a free-lance agent working for the CIA, and your mission is to recover (or kill) a kidnapped man who has devised a new Middle-east peace plan before his knowledge can be used to further less-than-peaceful causes.'),(2200,'User','You are a CIA agent with a respect for China, and one of your most brilliant Chinese foes has decided to defect, under the condition that you assist him in his efforts....'),(2201,'User','You\'re a CIA agent posing as a Canadian arms dealer and... wait, that sounds like book two. But, no, this is different. Anyway, you\'re an agent, and you have to go on a dangerous mission, and... Oh, never mind. It\'s the same as the other books, give or take a plot element.'),(2202,'User','It\'s World War II, and you\'re a spy in Europe trying to help save the world. It\'s still pretty much the same as the rest of the series, but now it\'s historical!'),(2203,'User','You\'re a relatively inexperienced (but skilled) agent about to end up on a mission in Libya, with some very personal reasons to hope for success....'),(2205,'LC','The reader, a school reporter and amateur detective, overhears a suspicious conversation in a sporting goods store that may affect an upcoming marathon. A course of action must be decided on right away.'),(2206,'LC','The reader follows clues and directs the course of the investigation into the mysterious disappearance of a famous rock star.'),(2207,'LC','The reader, overhearing a conversation about a plot to kidnap a millionaire\'s son at a Little League game, makes decisions which determine the outcome of the story.'),(2208,'LC','As you, the reader, work on a newspaper story about your town\'s annual bicycle race, your suspicions are aroused that something sinister is happening involving the new electronics plant.'),(2224,'User','Sonic gets distracted by a tough Game Gear game, and while he\'s not looking, all of his friends are kidnapped. This is particularly frustrating because he really wants to consult with one of his buddies on how to beat the final boss.'),(2225,'User','Sonic and Tails are napping when they are suddenly interrupted by a bulldozer tearing up the countryside. Unsurprisingly, Dr. Robotnik isn\'t far behind.'),(2226,'User','Robotnik has created an evil duplicate of Sonic, and it must be stopped quickly!'),(2227,'User','Sonic must undo the results of Dr. Robotnik\'s latest creation, a device which turns good into evil and evil into good.'),(2228,'User','Sonic pays a visit to a new theme park only to discover it is a decidedly unsafe environment.'),(2229,'User','Sonic\'s home in the Green Hill Zone is suddenly plagued by bizarre and dangerous weather.'),(2231,'User','A tribe of barbarians have taken you captive. They strip you of all your clothing and weapons and force you into a dungeon. If you successfully overcome all challenges within, they will crown you their king. '),(2232,'User','A powerful drug trader has offered you a considerable amount of money to smuggle a cargo into Gull, the City of Terrors.'),(2235,'User','A ship merchant hires you to infiltrate a group of dock workers he suspects of stealing his cargo.'),(2237,'User','You go into a rough tavern called Seven Ayes and, as expected, end up getting into trouble.'),(2239,'User','You decide to take a stroll through the city of Khazan, where adventure awaits you.'),(2245,'User','A man hires you to infiltrate the royal palace and steal a scroll located therein.'),(2247,'User','You find yourself in a wilderness with no recollection of how you got there, and start having adventures.'),(2249,'User','The sorceress who rules over Khazan has put you in command of a ship and directed you to sail to a distant city in order to collect tribute.'),(2251,'User','The captain of Gull\'s City Guard has hired you to track down and either capture or kill a group of spies.'),(2310,'User','You are a smuggler. Your ship has been forced down to a distant planet by Imperial forces, and your wookie friend has been taken captive by them. You must infiltrate the ship where your friend is being held and rescue him. '),(2322,'User','Although the first release of the second edition of this game included no solitaire adventures, this revised and expanded edition added one.'),(2324,'User','This boxed set contains a simplified version of West End Games\' Star Wars RPG second edition rules. While other publishers released subsequent Star Wars-based roleplaying games in later years, this appears to have been the last Star Wars RPG to contain introductory solitaire adventures (though not the last Star 