nters in each location. It is designed to be played by a group of people (though it can be played solo without much difficulty), and it nominally requires a referee (though, again, it is entirely possible to play without one).',1),(2155,'Miscellaneous Works by Fiction Writing Spring 2013','',1),(2156,'Skylanders Universe Pick Your Portal','',1),(2157,'Twisted Stories','',1),(2158,'Determine Your Own Deviation','',1),(2159,'Sangue Inchiostro','Una serie di Daniele Daccò, direttore di Orgoglio Nerd',5),(2160,'Choose Your Own Adventure: Stranger Things','',1),(2161,'Nuovi Mondi','Collana dedicata ad episodi autoconclusivi, con diverse ambientazioni, e di diversi autori',5),(2162,'Dedalo','Una collana dai vasti orizzonti, per offrire ai lettori una panoramica completa sui librigioco più innovativi di tutto il mondo.',5),(2163,'Critical IF (ita)','',5),(2164,'Miscellaneous Works by Sarah Hingley','',1),(2165,'jī pí gē dá - bǎi biàn chuǎng guān dà tàn xiǎn xì liè [鸡皮疙瘩·百变闯关大探险系列]','Research by Hong Li [李泓].',14),(2166,'Tværveje','',22),(2167,'Hermacles Divide Gamebook, A','',1),(2168,'Create-A-Story','',1),(2169,'Age of Vapor','',5),(2170,'piccolo Libro Cattivo, Il','',5),(2171,'Terre Leggendarie','',5),(2172,'Gamebook (Watson edizioni)','The series is inspired by the late 19th and early 20th century literature. The original books are completely reinterpreted into the gamebook format.',5),(2173,'Misteri d\'Oriente (MS Edizioni)','La nuova edizione di Misteri d\'Oriente a cura di MS Edizioni, che probabilmente porterà a completamento la saga del Prete Gianni.',5),(2174,'Lambda House - Young Journalist','',5),(2175,'Honeste Avventure di Gigi, Le','',5),(2176,'zì wǒ lì xiǎn xiǎo shuō [自我历险小说]','',14),(2177,'Miscellaneous Works by Steve Rioux','',1),(2178,'You Say Which Way Adventure Quiz','The <a href=\"/Series/1667/\">You Say Which Way</a> series of books is aimed at 8-12 year olds, involves reading a chapter and then choosing which direction the story will take, rather than the usual selecting an option within a paragraph and navigating to that numbered section to move forward through the story. Various genres are covered including Fantasy and Sci-Fi. These publications are available both in paperback form (through Createspace) and for Kindle devices.\n\n<p>This series is a spin-off Adventure Quiz series.</p>',1),(2179,'Batman: The Brave and the Bold','Gamebooks based on the TV animated series of the same name (which in turn is based on a DC comic book series which dates back to the fifties). The books have no game system.\n\n<p>There have been several gamebook series and roleplaying solitaire adventures which have featured Batman and other DC Comics characters, though this series appears to be unrelated (except for the subject matter) to any of them.',1),(2180,'Entram Epic, The','',1),(2181,'chā tú běn mí nǐ tàn xiǎn cóng shū [插图本迷你探险丛书]','',14),(2182,'duō chóng jié jú mào xiǎn àn lì [多重結局冒險案例]','',14),(2183,'dà yǔ shén mì jīng qí xì liè [大宇神秘惊奇系列]','',14),(2184,'jīng xiǎn chà lù kǒu [惊险岔路口]','',14),(2185,'lǐ guó wěi zì wǒ lì xiǎn cóng shū [李国伟自我历险丛书]','',14),(2186,'màn huà ào lín pǐ kè kē huàn yóu xì [漫画奥林匹克科幻游戏]','',14),(2187,'mí jīn tàn àn xiǎo cóng shū [迷津探案小丛书]','',14),(2188,'nán fāng fèn jí yuè dú •guó nèi shǒu bù zì zhù tàn xiǎn xiǎo shuō xì liè [南方分级阅读•国内首部自助探险小说系列]','',14),(2189,'shǎo nián kē huàn zì zhù tàn xiǎn xiǎo shuō [少年科幻自助探险小说]','',14),(2190,'wàng wén shǎo nián zhēn tàn tuī lǐ xiǎo shuō xì liè [旺文少年偵探推理小說系列]','',14),(2191,'xiǎo xué shēng cóng shū [小学生丛书]','',14),(2192,'zhōng piān zì wǒ lì xiǎn xiǎo shuō [中篇自我历险小说]','',14),(2193,'zuì xīn shén qí lì xiǎn [最新神奇历险]','',14),(2194,'zì zhù tàn xiǎn xì liè [自助探险系列]','',14),(2195,'ér tóng huí dào guò qù xiǎo shuō xì liè [兒童回到過去小說系列]','',14),(2196,'ér tóng jí zhì xiǎo shuō xì liè / xīn shì jì jué zé cóng shū [兒童急智小說系列/ 新世紀抉擇叢書]','',14),(2197,'ér tóng kē huàn xiǎo shuō xì liè [兒童科幻小說系列]','',14),(2198,'ér tóng kǒng bù xiǎo shuō xì liè / líng huàn zhī lǚ xì liè  [兒童恐怖小說系列/ 靈幻之旅系